hadiths[369]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5557","abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne namaaze-eid se pahley qurbani zabah kar li thi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke iske badley mein dusri qurbani kar lo. unhon-ne arz kya ke mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ke bachchey ke siwa aur koi janwar nahi. Shoba ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha tha ke wo aik saal ki bakri se bhi umda hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir usi ki iske badley mein qurbani kar do lekin tumharey baad ye kisi ke liye kafi nahi hogi aur Haatim-bin-Wardaan ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse Muhammad ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aakhir hadis tak (is riwayat mein ye lafz hain) ke ''eik saal se kam Umr ki bachchii hai.''"
"5558","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani ki. maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne paon janwar ke uper rakhey huey hain aur bismillaahi-Allaahu-akbar padh rahe hain. is tarah aap ne donon mendhon ko apne hath se zabah kya."
"5559","maqam sarf main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey aur main ro rahi thi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya baat hai, kya tumhen haiz aa gaya hai? maine arz kya ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to Allah Taala ne Adam ki betiyon ki taqdeer mein likh diya hai. isliye haajiyon ki tarah tamam aa'maale Haj anjam do sirf Kaba ka tawaaf na karo aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne beeviyon ki taraf se gaaey ki qurbani ki."
"5560","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba de rahe they. khutbe mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aaj ke din ki shuruaat ham Namaz (eid) se karengey phir wapas aa kar qurbani karengey jo shakhs is tarah karega wo hamari sunnat ko pa lega lekin jisne (eid ki Namaz se pahley) janwar zabah kar liya to wo aisa gosht hai jisey usne apne ghar walon ke khaney ke liye taiyaar kya hai wo qurbani kisi darje mein bhi nahi. abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine to eid ki Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li hai albatta mere paas abhi aik saal se kam Umr ka aik bakri ka bachcha hai aur saal bhar ki bakri se behtar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum usi ki qurbani uske badle mein karo lekin tumharey baad ye kisi ke liye jaaiz na hoga."
"5561","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li ho wo dobara qurbani kare. is par aik sahabi uthey aur arz kya : (ya rasoolullaah!) us din gosht ki logon ko khahish zyada hoti hai phir unhon-ne apne padausiyon ki mohtaajii ka zikr kya jaisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka uzr qabool kar liya ho ( unhon-ne ye bhi kaha ke) mere paas aik saal ka aik bachcha hai aur bakriyon se bhi achchha hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein iske qurbani ki ijazat de di lekin mujhey iska ilm nahi ke ye ijazat dusron ko bhi thi ya nahi phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 mendhon ki taraf mutwajjeh huey. unki murad ye thi ke unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zabah kya phir log bakriyon ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhein zabah kya."
"5562","qurbani ke din main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li ho wo uski jagah dobara karey aur jisne qurbani abhi na ki ho wo kare."
"5563","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik din Namaz eid padhi aur farmaya ke jo hamari tarah Namaz padhta ho aur hamarey qible ko qibla banata ho wo namaaze-eid se farigh honey se pahley qurbani na kare. is par abu-Barda-bin-Niyaar (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine to qurbani kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir wo aik aisi cheez hui jisey tum ne waqt se pahley hi kar liya hai. unhon-ne arz kya mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ka aik bachcha hai jo aik saal ki 2 bakriyon se umda hai. kya main usey zabah kar loon. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kar lo lekin tumharey baad ye kisi aur ke liye jaaiz nahi hai. Aamir ne bayan kya ke ye unki behtreen qurbani thi."
"5564","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seeng waley 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani kya kartey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna paon unki gardanon ke uper rakhtey aur unhein apne hath se zabah kartey they."
"5565","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seeng waley 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani ki. unhein apne hath se zabah kya. bismillaahi Allahu-akbar padha aur apna paon unki gardan ke uper rakh kar zabah kya."
"5566","wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein aaey aur arz kya ke ummul-momeneen! agar koi shakhs qurbani ka janwar Kaba mein bhej de aur khud apne Shahar mein muqeem ho aur jiske zariey bhejey usey uski wasiiyat kar de ke iske janwar ke galley main (nishaanii ke taur par) aik haar pehna diya jaey to kya us din se wo us waqt tak ke liye mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ho jaeyga jab tak haji apna ehram na khol lein. bayan kya ke is par maine pardey ke peechhey Ummul-Momenin ke apne aik hath se doosrey hath par maarney ki awaz suni aur unhon-ne kaha, main khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qurbani ke janwaron ke haar bandhti thi, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey Kaba bhejtey they lekin logon ke wapas honey tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par koi cheez haram nahi hoti thi jo unke ghar ke doosrey logon ke liye halal ho."
"5567","Madina pahunchne tak ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein qurbani ka gosht jama kartey they aur kai martaba ( bajaey ( لحوم الأضاحي ( ke) ( لحوم الهدى‏ . Mina (ka lafz istemal kya."
"5568","wo safar mein they jab wapas aaey to unke samney gosht laya gaya. kaha gaya ke ye hamari qurbani ka gosht hai. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke usey hataao mein usey nahi chakhoonga. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir uth gaya aur ghar se bahar nikal kar apne bhai abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya wo maa ki taraf se unke bhai they aur badr ki ladai mein shirkat karne walon mein se they. maine unse iska zikr kya aur unhon-ne kaha ke tumharey baad hukm badal gaya hai."
"5569","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne tum mein se qurbani ki to teesrey din wo us haalat mein subah karey ke uske ghar mein qurbani ke gosht mein se kuchh bhi baqi na ho. doosrey saal sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya ham is saal bhi wahi karein jo pichhley saal kya tha. (ke teen din se zyada qurbani ka gosht bhi na rakhein). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab khaao, khilaao aur jama karo. pichhley saal to chunkey log tangi mein mubtala they, isliye maine chaha ke tum logon ki mushkilaat mein unki madad karo."
"5570","Madina mein ham qurbani ke gosht mein namak laga kar rakh detey they aur phir usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhi pesh kartey they phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qurbani ka gosht teen din se zyada na khaya karo. ye hukm zaroori nahi tha balke aap ka mansha ye tha ke ham qurbani ka gosht (un logon ko bhi jinke yahan qurbani na hui ho ( khilaaein aur Allah zyada jaanney wala hai."
"5571","mujhey ibne- azhar ke ghulam abu Ubaid ne bayan kya ke wo Baaqar eid ke din umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath eidgaah mein maujood they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne khutbe se pahley eid ki Namaz padhai phir logon ke samney khutba diya aur khutbe mein farmaya aey logo ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen 2 Eidon mein roza rakhney se mana farmaya hai aik wo din hai jis din tum ( Ramazan ke) rozey poorey karke iftaar kartey ho ( eidul-fitr (aur doosra tumhari qurbani ka din hai."
"5572","phir main Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath (unki khilafat ke zamane mein eidgaah mein) hazir tha. us din Juma bhi tha. aap ne khutbe se pahley Namaz eid padhai phir khutba diya aur farmaya ke aey logo ! aaj ke din tumharey liye 2 eidein jama ho gaee hain. ( eid aur Juma ( aas-paas ke rehney walon mein se jo shakhs pasand karey Juma ka bhi intizar karey aur agar koi wapas jana chahey (namaz eid ke baad hi ( to wo wapas ja sakta hai, maine usey ijazat de di hai."
"5573","phir main eid ki Namaz mein Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath aaya. unhon-ne bhi Namaz khutbe se pahley padhai phir logon ko khutba diya aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen apni qurbani ka gosht teen din se zyada khaney ki manaahii ki hai aur Mamar ne Zohri se aur unse abu-Ubaida ne isi tarah bayan kya."
"5574","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qurbani ka gosht teen din tak khaao. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Mina se kooch kartey waqt roti Zaitoon ke tel se khaatey, kyonke wo qurbani ke gosht se ( teen din ke baad) parhez kartey they."
"5575","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne duniya mein sharab pi aur phir us ne tauba nahi ki to aakhirat mein wo us se mahroom rahega."
"5576","jis raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meraaj karaai gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) baitul-maqdis ke Shahar ( iiliyaa mein sharab aur doodh ke 2 pyaley pesh kiye gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doodh ka piyala ley liya. is par Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha us Allah ke liye tamam ta'reefein hain jisne aapko Deen fitrat ki taraf chalney ki hidayat farmai . agar aap ne sharab ka piyala ley liya hota to aap ki ummat gumrah ho jati. Shuaib ke sath us hadis ko Mamar , ibnul-haad, Usman bin umr aur Zubaidi ne Zohri se naql kya hai."
"5577","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik hadis suni jo tum se ab mere siwa koi aur nahi bayan karega (kyonke ab mere siwa koi sahabi zinda maujood nahi raha hai). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ki nishaniyon mein se ye hai ke jahaalat ghalib ho jaeygi aur ilm kam ho jaeyga zinaakaarii badh jaeygi, sharab kasarat se pi janey lagegii, auratein bahut ho jaaeingii, yahan tak ke pachaas-pachaas aurton ki nigrani karne wala sirf aik hi mard reh jaeyga"
"5578","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs jab zina karta hai to theek zina kartey waqt wo momin nahi hota. isi tarah jab wo sharab peetaa hai to theek sharab peetey waqt wo momin nahi hota. isi tarah jab chor chori karta hai to us waqt wo momin nahi hota aur ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya, unhein Abdul-Malik -bin-abi-Bakr bin Abdur-Rehman bin Haris-bin-Hisham ne khabar di, unse Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey they aur unse Abu-Hurera (rz). phir unhon-ne bayan kya ke Abu-Bakar bin Abdur-Rehman Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis mein zikr kiye huey maamlon ke sath itna aur zyada kartey they ke koi shakhs (din dahaadey) agar kisi badi poonjii par is tarah daaka daalta hai ke log dekhtey ke dekhtey reh jatey hain to wo momin rahtey huey ye loot-maar nahi karta."
"5579","jab sharab haram ki gaee to angoor ki sharab Madina Munawra mein nahi miltii thi."
"5580","ham se Yunus ne, unse Sabit Bunani ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab sharab ham par haram ki gaee to Madina Munawra mein angoor ki sharab bahut kam miltii thi. aam istemal ki sharab kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5581","ham se Aamir ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) mimber par khadey huey aur kaha ammaa ba'd! jab sharab ki hurmat ka hukm nazil hua to wo panch chizon se bantii thi angoor, khajoor, shahad, gehun aur jau aur sharab (khamr) wo hai jo aql ko mitaa de."
"5582","mein abu-Ubaida, abu-Talha aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ko kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki hui sharab pilaa raha tha ke aik aaney waley ne aa kar bataya ke sharab haram kar di gaee hai. us waqt abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Anas utho aur sharab ko baha do chunanche maine usey baha diya."
"5583","aik qabeele mein khada main apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharab pilaa raha tha main unmein sabse kam Umr tha. kisi ne kaha ke sharab haram kar di gaee. un hazraat ne kaha ke ab usey phenk do. chunanche ham ne sharab phenk di. maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke wo kis cheez ki sharab bantii thi? farmaya ke taaza pakkii hui aur kachchi khajooron ki. Abu-Bakar bin Anas ne kaha ke unki sharab ( khajoor ki) hoti thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska inkar nahi kya aur mujh se mere kuchh ashaab ne bayan kya ke unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke us zamane mein unki sharab aksar kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5584","mujh se Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab sharab haram ki gaee to wo kachchi aur pukhta khajooron se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5585","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (bitaa') ke mutaalliq puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo bhi peeney wali cheez nasha laavey wo haram hai."
"5586","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( bitaa' (ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya. ye mashroob shehad se taiyaar kya jata tha aur Yaman mein iska aam riwaaj tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo cheez bhi nasha laney wali ho wo haram hai."
"5587","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ''dabbaa''aur ''muzaffat'' mein nabeez na banaya karo aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) iske sath '' hantam ''aur '' naqeer '' ka bhi izafa kya kartey they."
"5588","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke member par khutba detey huey kaha jab sharab ki hurmat ka hukm hua to wo panch chizon se bantii thi. angoor se, khajoor se, gehun se, jau aur shehad se aur (khamr) wo hai jo aql nasha taarii kar de aur teen masayel aisey hain ke meri tamanna thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se juda honey se pahley hamein unka hukm bata jatey, dada ka mas'ala, kalaala ka masla aur sood ke chand masaayel. abu-Hayyan ne bayan kya ke maine Shabi se puchha : aey abu-Amr ! aik aisa sharbat hai jo sindh mein chaawal se banaya jata hai. unhon-ne kaha ke ye cheez Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein nahi paai jati thi ya kaha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamaney mein na thi aur farj ibne-minhaal ne bhi is hadis ko Hammaad-bin-Salma se bayan kya aur unse abu-Hayyan ne usmein angoor ke bajaey kishmish hai."
"5589","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke sharab panch chizon se bantii thi kishmish , khajoor , geihun, jau aur shehad se."
"5590","mujh se abu-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ya abu-Malik Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya : Allah ki qism ! unhon-ne jhoot nahi bayan kya ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein aisey burey log paida ho jaeinge jo zinaakaarii karenge, resham pehna karenge, sharab piyaa karenge aur gaaney bajaey ko halal bana lengey aur kuchh mutakabbir qism ke log pahaad ki choti par (apne banglon mein rihaaish karne ke liye) chaley jaengey. charwaahey unke maweshii subah w Sham laaengey aur ley jaengey. unke paas aik faqeer aadmi apni zarurat lekar jaeyga to wo taalney ke liye us se kahengey ke kal aana lekin Allah Taala raat ko unko (unki sarkashi ki wjah se) halaak kar dega pahaad ko (un par) gira dega aur unmein se bahut son ko qiyamat tak ke liye bandar aur Sura ki Suraton mein maskh kar dega."
"5591","abu-Usaid Malik bin Rabe aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne waleeme ki dawat di, unki biwi hi sab kaam kar rahi thin halanke wo nai dulhan thin. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya tumhen malum hai ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya pilaya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye unhon-ne patthar ke koondey mein raat ke waqt khajoor bhigo di thi."
"5592","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney ki (jin mein sharab bantii thi) manaahii kar di thi phir Ansar ne arz kya ke hamarey paas to doosrey bartan nahi hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to khair phir ijazat hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) kehtey hain mujh se khaleefa bin khayyaat ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sufiyan Sory ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor bin Motamir ne aur unse Saalim-bin abi-Jad ne phir yahi hadis riwayat ki thi."
"5593","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkon ke siwa aur bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaya to logon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! har kisi ko mashk kahan se mil sakti hai? us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bin laakh lagey ghadey ( raughane-zuft lagey bartan ( mein nabeez bhigoney ki ijazat de di. ham se Abdullah-bin Muhammad masnadii ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sufiyan Sory ne yahi bayan kya aur is mein yun hai ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaayaa."
"5594","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dabbaa aur muzaffat ( khas qism ke bartan jin mein sharab bantii thi) ke istemal ki bhi manaahii kar di thi. ham se Usman ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Jarir ne bayan kya, kaha unse Aamash ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5595","maine Aswad bin Yazeed se puchha kya tum ne Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha tha ke kis bartan mein nabeez (khajoor ka meethaa sharbat) banaanaa makruh hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan, maine arz kya ummul-momeneen! kis bartan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nabeez banaaney se mana farmaya tha. unhon-ne kaha ke khas ghar walon ko kadu ki tonbii aur laakhii bartan mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaya tha. (Ibraaheem Nakhai ne bayan kya ke) maine Aswad se puchha unhon-ne ghadey aur sabz martban ka zikr nahi kya. usne kaha ke main tum se wahi bayan karta hun jo maine suna, kya wo bhi bayan kar dun jo maine na suna ho?"
"5596","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sabz ghadey se mana farmaya tha, maine puchha kya ham safaid ghadon mein pi liya karein kaha ke nahi."
"5597","abu-Usaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne waleeme ki dawat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di, us din unki biwi (umme-Usaid Sulaamaa) hi mahmaanon ki khidmat kar rahi thin. bevi abu-Usaid ne kaha tum jantey ho maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye kis cheez ka sharbat taiyaar kya tha patthar ke koondey mein raat ke waqt kuchh khajoorein bhigo di thin aur doosrey din subah ko aapko pilaa di thi."
"5598","maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se ( باذق ( ) angoor ka sheera halki aanch diya hua) ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( باذق (ke wujood se pahley hi duniya se rukhsat ho gaey they jo cheez bhi nasha laey wo haram hai. abul-Juweriya ne kaha ke) باذق ( to halal w paak hai. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke angoor halal w paak tha jab uski sharab bin gaee to wo haram khabees hai (na ke halal w paak) ."
"5599","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) halwaa aur shehad ko dost rakhtey they."
"5600","maine abu-Talha, abu-Dujaana aur Suhel bin baizaa (Raziallahu anhu) ko kachchi khajoor ki mili hui nabeez pilaa raha tha ke sharab haram kar di gaee aur maine maujooda sharab phenk di. main hi unhein pilaa raha tha main sabse kam Umr tha. ham us nabeez ko us waqt sharab hi samajhtey they aur Amr-bin-Haris rawi ne bayan kya ke ham se Qatada ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"5601","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kishmish aur khajoor (ke sheere) ko aur taaza (pukhta, pakkii hui) khajoor aur neem pukhta (kachchii, gadrii hui) khajoor ko mila kar bhigoney se mana farmaya tha, us taur usmein nasha jaldi paida ho jata hai."
"5602","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski manaahii ki thi ke pukhta aur gadraaii hui khajoor, pukhta khajoor aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeez banaya jaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har aik ko juda judaa bhigoney ka hukm diya."
"5603","shabe-mea'raaj mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko doodh aur sharab ke 2 pyaley pesh kiye gaey."
"5604","Arfa ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke roza ke barey mein sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ko shuba tha. isliye maine aap ke liye aik bartan mein doodh bheja aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pi liya. Humaidii kehtey hain kabhi Sufiyan is hadis ko yun bayan kartey they ke Arfa ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke roze ke barey mein logon ko shuba tha isliye umme-fazal ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye (doodh) bhejaa. kabhi Sufiyan us hadis ko mursalan Umme- Fazal se riwayat kartey they, Salim aur Umer ka naam na letey. jab unse poochhtey ke ye hadis mursal hai ya marfooan muttasil to wo us waqt kehtey (marfooa muttasil hai) umme-Fazal se marwi (bayan) hai (jo sahaabiya thiin)."
"5605","abu Humaid Saaidi maqam naqeea' se doodh ka aik piyala (khulaa hua) laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey dhak kar kyon nahi laey aik lakdi hi is par rakh letey."
"5606","unhon-ne bayan kya ke aik Ansari sahabi abu Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) maqam naqeea' se aik bartan mein doodh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye laey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey dhak kar kyon nahi laaey, is par lakdi hi rakh detey aur Aamash ne kaha ke mujh se Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya, unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5607","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka Mukarrama se tashrif laey to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke sath they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke (raaste mein) ham aik charwaahey ke qareeb se guzrey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) piyaasey they phir maine aik pyaley main (charwaahey se poochh kar) kuchh doodh dohaa. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo doodh piyaa aur us se mujhey khushi hasil hui aur suraaqa-bin-Ja'sham ghodey par Sawar hamarey paas ( ta'aqub kartey huey) pahunch gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske liye baddua ki. aakhir usne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske haq mein baddua na karein aur wo wapas ho jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa hi kya."
"5608","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya hi umda sadqa hai khub doodh dene wali ontni jo kuchh dinon ke liye kisi ko Atiya ke taur par di gaee ho aur khub doodh dene wali bakri jo kuchh dinon ke liye Atiya ke taur par di gaee ho jis se subah w Sham doodh bartan bhar-bhar kar nikala jaey."
"5609","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doodh piyaa phir kulli ki aur farmaya ke ismein chiknaahat hoti hai."
"5610","unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab mujhey Sidratul-Muntahaa tak ley jaya gaya to wahan maine char nehrein dekhein . 2 zahiri nehrein aur 2 baatinii . zahiri nehrein to neel aur Furaat hain aur baatinii nehrein jannat ki 2 nehrein hain. phir mere paas teen pyaley laey gaey aik pyaley mein doodh tha, doosrey mein shehad tha aur teesrey mein sharab thi. maine wo piyala liya jis mein doodh tha aur piyaa . is par mujh se kaha gaya ke tum ne aur tumhari ummat ne asl fitrat ko pa liya. Hisham , Saeed aur Hammam ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Malik bin Sasa (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis riwayat ki hai. usmein nadiyon ka zikr to aisa hi hai lekin teen piyaalon ka zikr nahi hai."
"5611","abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas Madina ke tamam Ansar mein sabse zyada khajoor ke baghaat they aur unka sabse pasandida maal beerhaa ka baagh tha. ye masjide-Nabawi ke samney hi tha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan tashrif ley jatey they aur uska umda pani peetey they. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir jab aayat لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ''tum hargiz neki nahi paogey jab tak wo maal na kharch karo jo tumhen azeez ho.'' nazil hui to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah Taala farmata hai لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ''tum hargiz neki ko nahi paogey jab tak wo maal na kharch karo jo tumhen azeez ho.'' aur mujhey apne maal mein sabse zyada azeez beerhaa ka baagh hai aur wo Allah Taala ke raaste mein sadqa hai, iska sawab aur ajr main Allah ke yahan paaney ki ummeed rakhta hon, isliye ya Rasulullah ! aap jahan usey munasib khayal farmaein kharch karein. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khub ye bahut hi fayda bakhsh maal hai ya (iske bajaey aap ne) ( رايح ( ) ya ke sath farmaya ( . rawi hadis Abdullah ko usmein shak tha (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse mazeed farmaya ke) jo kuchh tu ney kaha hai maine sun liya mera khayal hai ke tum usey apne rishte-daaron ko de do. abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke aisa hi karunga ya Rasulullah! chunanche unhon-ne apne rishte daaron apne chacha ke ladkon mein usey taqseem kar diya aur Ismail aur Yahya-bin-Yahya ne ( رايح‏ (ka lafz naql kya hai."
"5612","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko doodh peetey dekha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke ghar tashrif laey they (bayaan kya ke) maine bakri ka doodh nikala aur is mein kuwein ka taaza pani mila kar (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) pesh kya aap ne piyala lekar piyaa . aap ke baain taraf Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) they aur daain taraf aik dehati tha aap ne apna baqi doodh dehati ko diya aur farmaya ke pahley daain taraf se, haan daain taraf waley ka haq hai."
"5613","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi ke yahan tashrif le gaey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aap ke aik rafeeq (abu-Bakar (rz)) bhi they. unse Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumharey yahan usi raat ka baasii pani kisi mishkeezey mein rakha hua ho (to hamein pulaao) warna munh laga ke pani pi lengey. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke wo sahib (jinke yahan aap tashrif liye gaey they) apne baagh mein pani de rahe they. bayan kya ke un sahib ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! mere paas raat ka baasii pani maujood hai, aap chhappar mein tashrif ley chalein. bayan kya ke phir wo un donon hazraat ko sath lekar gaey phir unhon-ne aik piyaale mein pani liya aur apni aik doodh dene wali bakri ka usmein doodh nikaalaa. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa, iske baad aap ke rafeeq Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne piyaa."
"5614","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sheerinii aur shehad ko dost rakhtey they."
"5615","wo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein masjid Kufa ke sehan mein hazir huey phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne khadey ho kar piyaa aur kaha ke kuchh log khadey ho kar pani peeney ko makruh samajhtey hain halanke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah kartey dekha hai jis tarah tum ne mujhey is waqt khadey ho kar pani peetey dekha hai."
"5616","unhon-ne Zohar ki Namaz padhi phir Kufa ki masjid ke sehan mein logon ki zarooraton ke liye baith gaey. us arse mein Asr ki Namaz ka waqt aa gaya phir unke paas pani laya gaya. unhon-ne pani piyaa aur apna chehra aur hath dhoey, unke sar aur paon (ke dhoney ka bhi) zikr kya. phir unhon-ne khadey ho kar wuzu ka bacha hua pani piyaa, iske baad kaha ke kuchh log khadey ho kar pani peeney ko bura samajhtey hain halanke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yoonhii kya tha jis tarah maine kya, wuzu ka pani khadey ho kar piyaa."
"5617","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamzam ka pani khadey ho kar piyaa."
"5618","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye doodh ka aik piyala bheja maidan Arafaat mein. wo Arfa ke din ki Sham (Syria) ka waqt tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apni sawari par) sawar they, aap ne apne hath mein wo piyala liya aur usey pi liya. Malik ne abu-Nazar se '' apne oont par '' ke alfaz zyada kiye."
"5619","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pani mila hua doodh pesh kya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dahini taraf aik dehati tha aur baain taraf Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pi kar baqi dehati ko diya aur farmaya ke daain taraf se, to daain taraf se."
"5620","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik sharbat laya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se piyaa , aap ke daain taraf aik ladka betha hua tha aur baain taraf boodhey log ( Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) jaisey baithey huey) they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachchey se kaha kya tum mujhey ijazat doge ke main un (boodhey logon) ko (pahley) de dun. ladkey ne kaha : Allah ki qasam, ya Rasulullah ! aap ke jhootey mein se milney waley apne hisse ke maamle mein, main kisi par eisaar nahi karunga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ladkey ke hath mein piyala de diya."
"5621","ham se Yahya bin Saleh ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne bayan kya, unse Saeed bin-Haaris ne aur unse Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi ke yahan tashrif ley gaey. aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aap ke aik rafeeq ne unhein salam kya aur unhoney salam ka jawab diya. phir arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! mere maan-baap aap par nisaar hun ye badi garmi ka waqt hai wo apney baagh mein pani dey rahey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya agar tumharey paas mashk mein raat ka rakha hua pani hai (to wo pilaa do) warna ham munh laga kar pi lengey. wo sahib is waqt bhii baagh mein pani dey rahey they. unhoney arz kya ya Rasulullah! mere paas mashk mein raat ka rakha hua baasii pani hai phir wo chheid (jhaunpdii) mein gaey aur aik pyaley mein baasii pani pi liya phir apni aik doodh dene wali bakri ka doodh is mein nikaalaa. aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa phir wo dobara laey aur is martaba aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rafeeq Hazrat siddeeqe-akbar (Raziallahu anhu) ne piyaa."
"5622","main khada hua apne qabeele mein apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharab pilaa raha tha. main unmein se sabse chhota tha, itney mein kisi ne kaha ke sharab haram kar di gaee ( abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha ke sharab phenk do. chunanche ham ne phenk di. Sulaiman ne kaha ke maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha us waqt log kis cheez ki sharab peetey they kaha ke pakkii aur kachchi khajoor ki Abu-Bakar bin Anas ne kaha ke yahi unki sharab hoti thi Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska inkar nahi kya, bakr-bin-abdullaah Muzni ya Qatada ne kaha aur mujh se kuchh logon ne bayan kya ke unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke '' unki un dinon yahi ( فضیح ( unki sharab thi. ''"
"5623","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raat ki jab shuruaat ho ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( jab Sham ho to apne bachchon ko rok lo (aur ghar se bahar na nikalney do) kyonke us waqt shaitan phail jatey hain phir jab raat ki aik ghadi guzar jaey to unhein chhod do aur darwazey band kar lo aur us waqt Allah ka naam lo kyonke shaitan band darwazey ko nahi kholtaa aur Allah ka naam lekar apne mishkezon ka munh baandh do. Allah ka naam lekar apne bartanon ko dhak do, chahe kisi cheez ko chaudai mein rakh kar hi dhak sako aur apne charagh (soney se pahley) bujhaa diya karo."
"5624","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum jab soney lago to charagh bujhaa do. darwazey band kar do, mashkon ke munh baandh do aur khaney peeney ke bartanon ko dhanp do. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye bhi kaha chahe lakdi hi ke zariey se dhak sako jo uski chaudai mein bismillaah keh kar rakh di jaey."
"5625","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkon mein (ikhtinaas) se mana farmaya. mashk ka munh khol kar usmein munh laga kar pani peeney se rokaa."
"5626","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke aap ne mashkon main (ikhtinaas) se mana farmaya hai. Abdullah ne bayan kya ke Mamar ne bayan kya ya unke ghair ne ke (ikhtinaas) mashk se munh laga kar pani peeney ko kehtey hain."
"5627","ham se Ikrima ne kaha, tumhen mein chand chhoti chhotii baatein na bata dun jinhein ham se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se munh laga kar pani peeney ki manaahii ki thi aur (is se bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya tha ke) koi shakhs apne padaus ko apni diwar mein khoontii wghaira gaadney se rokey."
"5628","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se pani peeney ki manaahii farma di thi."
"5629","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se pani peeney ko mana farmaya tha."
"5630","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs pani piey to (peeney ke) bartan main (paanii peetey huey) saans na ley aur jab tum mein se koi shakhs peshab karey to daahiney hath ko zakar (private part) par na pherey aur jab istinja karey to daahiney hath se na kare."
"5631","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) 2 ya teen saanson mein pani peetey they."
"5632","Huzefa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) madaain mein they. unhon-ne pani maanga to aik dehati ne unko chandi ke bartan mein pani la kar diya, unhon-ne bartan ko is par phenk maara phir kaha maine bartan sirf is wjah se phainkaa hai ke us shakhs ko main us se mana kar chuka tha lekin ye baaz na aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham w deebaa ke pahnney se aur soney aur chandi ke bartan mein khaney peeney se mana kya tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya tha ke ye cheezein un kuffaar ke liye duniya mein hain aur tumhen aakhirat mein milengey."
"5633","ham Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath nikley phir unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke soney aur chandi ke piyaale mein na piyaa karo aur na resham w deebaa pehna karo kyonke ye cheezein unke liye duniya mein hain aur tumharey liye aakhirat mein hain."
"5634","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs chandi ke bartan mein koi cheez peetaa hai to wo shakhs apne pet mein dozakh ki aag bhadkaa raha hai."
"5635","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) chizon ka hukm diya tha aur saat (7) chizon se ham ko mana farmaya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein bimar ki iyaadat karne, janazey ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ke jawab main ( يرحمك الله ( kahney, dawat karne waley ki dawat ko qabool karne, salam phailaaney, mazloom ki madad karne aur qism khaney ke baad kaffara ada karne ka hukm farmaya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney ki angoothiyon se, chandi mein peeney ya (farmaayaa) chandi ke bartan mein peeney se, میثر (zeen ya kajaawa ke uper resham ka gaddaa (ke istemal karne se aur qassi (misr ke aas-paas taiyaar kya janey wala aik kapda jis mein resham ke dhaagey bhi istemal hotey they) ke istemal karne se aur resham w deebaa aur istibraq pahnney se mana farmaya tha."
"5636","logon ne Arfa ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rozey ke mutaalliq shuba kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein doodh ka aik katora pesh kya gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey nosh farmaayaa."
"5637","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik Arab aurat ka zikr kya gaya phir aap ne Usaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ko unke paas unhein laney ke liye kisi ko bhejney ka hukm diya chunanche unhon-ne bheja aur wo aaiin aur banii-Saaida ke qile mein utriin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi tashrif laey aur unke paas gaey. aap ne dekha ke aik aurat sar jhukaaey baithi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab unse guftgu ki to wo kehney lagiin ke main tum se Allah ki panah maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke maine tujh ko panah dii! logon ne baad mein unse poochha. tumhen malum bhi hai ye kon they. us aurat ne jawab diya ke nahi. logon ne kaha ke ye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) they tum se nikah ke liye tashrif laey they. is par wo boliin ke phir to main badi bad-bakht hun (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko naraz karke wapas kar diyaa) isi din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur Saqeefa bani saaida main apne sahabi ke sath baithey phir farmaya ke Sahal! pani pulaao. maine unke liye ye piyala nikala aur unhein usmein pani pilaayaa. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey liye bhi wahi piyala nikal kar laey aur ham ne bhi usmein pani piyaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir baad mein khaleefa Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne unse ye maang liya tha aur unhon-ne ye unko hiba kar diya tha."
"5638","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka piyala Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas dekha hai wo phat gaya tha to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey chandi se jod diya. phir Aasim ne bayan kya ke wo umda chaudaa piyala hai. chamakdaar lakdi ka bana hua. bayan kya ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke maine us piyaale se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bahut baar pilaya hai. rawi ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Sirin ne kaha ke us piyaale mein lohey ka aik halqa tha. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne chaha ke uski jagah chandi ya soney ka halqa judwaa dein lekin abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha ke jisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banaya hai is mein hargiz koi tabdili na karo chunanche unhon-ne ye irada chhod diya."
"5639","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha aur Asr ki Namaz ka waqt ho gaya thodey se bachey huey pani ke siwa hamarey paas aur koi pani nahi tha usey aik bartan mein rakh kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein apna hath daala aur apni ungliyan phaila diin phir farmaya aao wuzu kar lo ye Allah ki taraf se barkat hai. maine dekha ke pani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ke darmyan se phoot-phoot kar nikal raha tha chunanche sab logon ne us se wuzu kya aur piyaa bhii. maine uski parwah kiye baghair ke pet mein kitna pani ja raha hai khub pani piyaa kyonke mujhey malum ho gaya tha ke barkat ka pani hai. maine Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha aap log us waqt kitni tadaad mein they? batlaya ke aik hazaar char so. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Amr ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ki hai aur Husain aur Amr-bin-Murra ne Salim se bayan kya aur unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke sahaba ki us waqt tadaad pandarah so thi. uski mutabiat (pairavi) Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ki hai."
"5640","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo museebat bhi kisi musalman ko pahunchti hai Allah Taala usey uske gunah ka kaffara kar deta hai (kisi musalman ke) aik kaantaa bhi agar jism ke kisi hisse mein chubh jaey."
"5641","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman jab bhi kisi pareshaanii, beemaarii, ranj w malaal, takleef aur gham mein mubtala ho jata hai yahan tak ke agar usey koi kaantaa bhi chubh jaey to Allah Taala usey uske gunahon ka kaffara bana deta hai."
"5642","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman jab bhi kisi pareshaanii, beemaarii, ranj w malaal, takleef aur gham mein mubtala ho jata hai yahan tak ke agar usey koi kaantaa bhi chubh jaey to Allah Taala usey uske gunahon ka kaffara bana deta hai."
"5643","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin ki misal paudey ki sabse pehli nikli hui harii shaakh jaisi hai ke hawa usey kabhi jhukaa deti hai aur kabhi barabar kar deti hai aur munafiq ki misal Sanoobar ke darakht jaisi hai ke wo seedha hi khada rehta hai aur aakhir aik jhokey mein kabhi ukhad hi jata hai. aur Zakariya ne bayan kya ke ham se Sad ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Ka'b ne bayan kya, unse unke walid maajid mohtaram Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi bayan kya."
"5644","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin ki misal paudey ki pehli nikli hui harii shaakh jaisi hai ke jab bhi hawa chaltii hai usey jhukaa deti hai phir wo seedha ho kar museebat bardasht karne mein kaamyaab ho jata hai aur badkaar ki misal sanoobar ke darakht jaisi hai ke sakht hota hai aur seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah Taala jab chahta hai usey ukhaad kar phenk deta hai."
"5645","maine Saeed bin Yasar Abul-Hubaab se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala jiske sath khair w bhalai karna chahta hai usey bimari ki takaaleef aur dusri museebaton mein mubtala kar deta hai."
"5646","maine (wafaat k marz ki takleef) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada aur kisi mein nahi dekhi."
"5647","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aap ke marz ke zamane mein hazir hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt badey tez bukhar mein they. maine arz kya : (ya rasoolullaah!) aapko bada tez bukhar hai. maine ye bhi kaha ke ye bukhar aapko isliye itna tez hai ke aap ka sawab bhi 2 guna hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, jo musalman kisi bhi takleef mein giraftaar hota hai to Allah Taala uski wjah se uske gunah is tarah jhaad deta hai jaisey darakht ke pattey jhad jatey hain."
"5648","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aapko shadeed bukhar tha maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aapko bahut tez bukhar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, mujhey tanha aisa bukhar hota hai jitna tum mein ke 2 aadmiyon ko hota hai. maine arz kya ye isliye ke aap ka sawab bhi 2 guna hai? farmaya ke haan, yahi baat hai, musalman ko jo bhi takleef pahunchti hai kaatna ho ya us se zyada takleef dene wali koi cheez to jaisey darakht apne patton ko giraataa hai isi tarah Allah paak us takleef ko us ( musalman (ke gunahon ka kaffara bana deta hai."
"5649","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bhookey ko khana khilaao aur mareez ki iyaadat yani mizaaj pursi karo aur qaidi ko chhudaao."
"5650","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) baton ka hukm diya tha aur saat (7) baton se mana farmaya tha. hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki anguthi , resham , deebaa , istibraq ( reshamii kapdey ( pahnney se aur qassi aur مثیرہ ( reshamii ( kapdon ki dusri qismein pahnney se mana farmaya tha aur aap ne hamein ye hukm diya tha ke ham janaaze ke peechhey chalein, mareez ki mizaaj pursi karein aur salam ko phailaaein."
"5651","main aik martaba bimar padaa to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) paidal meri iyaadat ko tashrif laey un buzurgon ne dekha ke mujh par be-hoshii ghalib hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya aur apne wuzu ka pani mujh par chhidkaa, us se mujhey hosh aa gaya to maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif rakhtey hain, maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main apne maal mein kya karun kis tarah iska faisla karun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey koi jawab nahi diya. yahan tak ke meeraas ki aayat nazil hui."
"5652","mujh se Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, tumhen mein aik jannati aurat ko na dikhaa dun? maine arz kya ke zaroor dikhaaiin , kaha ke aik siyah aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aai aur kaha ke mujhey mirgii aati hai aur uski wjah se mera sattar (badan) khul jata hai. mere liye Allah Taala se dua kar dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar to chahey to sabr kar tujhey jannat milegii aur agar chahey to main terey liye Allah se is marz se nijat ki dua kar dun. us ne arz kya ke main sabr karoongii phir us ne arz kya ke mirgii ke waqt mera sattar khul jata hai. aap Allah Taala se uski dua kar dein ke sattar na khula kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske liye dua farmai."
"5653","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ka irshad hai ke jab main apne kisi bande ko uske 2 mahboob aaza (aankhon) ke barey mein aazmaata hun (yani naa-beenaa kar deta hun (aur wo is par sabr karta hai to iske badley mein usey jannat deta hun."
"5654","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hijrat karke Madina tashrif laey to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko bukhar ho gaya. bayan kya ke phir main unke paas (iyaadat ke liye) gaee aur poochha, mohtaram walid aap ka mizaaj kaisa hai? Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi puchha ke aap ka kya haal hai? bayan kya ke jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bukhar hua to wo ye sher padha kartey they ''har shakhs apne ghar walon mein subah karta hai aur maut uske tasmey se bhi zyada qareeb hai.'' aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko jab fayda hota to ye sher padhtey they ''kaash mujhey malum hota ke kya phir aik raat wadi mein guzaar sakunga aur mere charon taraf izkhir aur Jaleel (Makka Mukarrama ki ghaas (ke jangal hongey aur kya main kabhi Mujanna (Makka se chand miil ke faasle par aik baazaar) ke pani par utroonga aur kya phir kabhi shaamma aur Tufail (Makka ke qareeb 2 pahaadon) ko main apne samney dekh sakoonga.'' Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur aapko uski itlaa di Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai ke aey Allah ! hamarey dil mein Madina ki mohabbat bhi utni hi kar de jitni Makka ki mohabbat hai balke us se bhi zyada aur uski aab w hawa ko hamarey muwafiq kar de aur hamarey liye iske mudd aur saa mein barkat ata farma, Allah iska bukhar kahin aur jagah muntaqil kar de usey maqam Johfa mein bhej de."
"5655","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sahibzadi ( Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ( ne aapko kahlwaa bhejaa. us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sad (Raziallahu anhu) aur hamara khayal hai ke Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) they ke meri bachchii bistare-marg par padi hai is liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif laaiin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein salam kahlwaayaa aur farmaya ke Allah Taala ko ikhtiyar hai jo chahey de aur jo chahey le-ley har cheez iske yahan mutaiyan w malum hai. isliye Allah se us museebat par ajr ki ummeedwaar raho aur sabr karo. sahibzadi ne phir dobara qism de kar aik aadmi bulaney ko bhejaa. chunanche aap khadey huey aur ham bhi aap ke sath khadey ho gaey phir bachchii Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki god mein utha kar rakhi gaee aur wo jaan nikalney ki haalat mein pareshan thi. aap ki aankhon mein aansu aa gaey. is par Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! ye kya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye rehmat hai. Allah Taala apne bandon mein se jiske dil mein chahta hai rakhta hai aur Allah Taala bhi apne unhein bandon par raham karta hai jo khud bhi raham karne waley hotey hain."
"5656","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dehati ke paas uski iyaadat ke liye tashrif ley gaey. rawi ne bayan kya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi ki iyaadat ko tashrif ley jatey to mareez se farmatey ''koii fikr ki baat nahi. inshaAllah ye marz gunahon se paak karne wala hai'' lekin us dehati ne aap ke un Mubarak kalimaat ke jawab mein kaha ke aap kehtey hain ke ye paak karne wala hai hargiz nahi balke ye bukhar aik boodhey par ghalib aa gaya hai aur usey qabr tak pahuncha ke rahega. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aisa hi hoga."
"5657","aik Yahudi ladka Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat kya karta tha wo bimar hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski mizaaj pursi ke liye tashrif laey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Islam qabool kar ley chunanche us ne Islam qabool kar liya aur Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne bayan kya apne walid se ke jab abu-Taalib ki wafat ka waqt qareeb hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas mizaaj pursi ke liye tashrif ley gaey."
"5658","kuchh sahaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aap ke aik marz ke doran mizaaj pursi karne aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein baith kar Namaz padhai lekin sahaba khadey ho kar hi Namaz padh rahe they. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein baithney ka ishara kya. Namaz se farigh honey ke baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski iqtida (pairvi) ki jaey to jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo, jab wo sar uthaey to tum ( muqtadi ( bhi uthao aur agar wo baith kar Namaz padhey to tum bhi baith kar padho. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Humaidii ke mutabiq ye hadis mansukh hai kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aakhir (maut ke marz ( mein Namaz baith kar padhai aur log aap ke peechhey khadey ho kar iqtida (pairvi) kar rahe they."
"5659","unke walid ( Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne bayan kya ke main Makka mein bahut sakht bimar pad gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri mizaaj pursi ke liye tashrif laey. maine arz kya : aey Allah ke nabii! (agar wafat ho gaee to) main maal chhodunga aur mere paas siwa aik ladki ke aur koi waaris nahi hai. kya main apne 2 tehai maal ki wasiiyat kar dun aur aik tehai chhod dun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi maine arz kya phir aadhey ki wasiiyat kar dun aur aadha (apni bachchii ke liye) chhod dun. farmaya ke nahi phir maine kaha ke aik tehai ki wasiiyat kar dun aur baqi 2 tehai ladki ke liye chhod dun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik tehai kar do aur aik tehai bhi bahut hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath unki peshani par rakha (Sa'd (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya (aur mere chehrey aur pet par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna Mubarak hath phera phir farmaya : aey Allaah! Sad ko shifa ata farma aur uski hijrat ko mukammal kar. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath ki thandak apne jigar ke hisse par main ab tak pa raha hun."
"5660","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aapko bukhar aaya hua tha maine apne hath se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka jism chhuwa aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aapko to bada tez bukhar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, mujhey tum mein ke 2 aadmiyon ke barabar bukhar chadhtaa hai. maine arz kya ye isliye hoga ke aapko dugnaa ajr milta hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi bhi musalman ko marz ki takleef ya koi aur takleef hoti hai to Allah Taala uske gunahon ko is tarah giraataa hai jaisey darakht apne patton ko gira deta hai."
"5661","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab aap bimar they hazir hua. maine aap ka jism chhuwaa, aapko tez bukhar tha. maine arz kya aapko to bada tez bukhar hai ye isliye hoga ke aapko dugnaa sawab milega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, aur kisi musalman ko bhi jab koi takleef pahunchti hai to iske gunah is tarah jhad jatey hain jaisey darakht ke pattey jhad jatey hain."
"5662","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik shakhs ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif le gaey aur unse farmaya ke لا بأس طهور إن شاء الله''koii fikr nahi agar Allah ne chaha (ye marz ( gunahon se paak karne wala hoga'' lekin us ne ye jawab diya ke hargiz nahi ye to aisa bukhar hai jo aik boodhey par ghalib aa chuka hai aur usey qabr tak pahuncha kar hi rahega, is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aisa hi hoga."
"5663","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gadhey ki paalaan par fidak ki chadar daal kar is par Sawar huey aur Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne peechhey sawar kya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki iyaadat ko tashrif ley ja rahe they, ye jange-badr se pahley ka waqia hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rawaana huey aur aik majlis se guzrey jis mein Abdullah-bin-Ubai bin salool bhi tha. Abdullah abhi musalman nahi hua tha us majlis mein har giroh ke log they musalman bhi, mushrekeen bhi yani but parast aur Yahudi bhii. majlis mein Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they, sawari ki gard jab majlis tak pahunchi to Abdullah-bin-Ubai ne apni chadar apni naak par rakh li aur kaha ke ham par gard na udaao. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein salam kya aur sawari rok kar wahan utar gaey phir aap ne unhein Allah ke taraf bulaya aur Quran Majeed padh kar sunaya. is par Abdullah-bin-Ubai ne kaha miyan tumhari baatein meri samajh mein nahi aatiin agar haq hain to hamari majlis mein unhein bayan karke ham ko takleef na pahunchaya karo, apne ghar jao wahan jo tumharey paas aaey us se bayan karo. is par ibne- Rawaha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kyon nahi ya Rasulullah ! aap hamari majlison mein zaroor tashrif laaein kyonke ham un baton ko pasand kartey hain. is par muslmaanon, mushrikon aur yahudiyon mein jhagdey bazi ho gaee aur qareeb tha ke aik doosrey par hamla kar baithtey lekin aap unhein khamosh kartey rahe yahan tak ke sab khamosh ho gaey phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari par Sawar ho kar Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan tashrif le gaey aur unse farmaya Sad ! tum ne suna nahi abu-Hubaab ne kya kaha, aap ka ishara Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki taraf tha. is par Sad (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke ya Rasulullah! usey maaf kar dijiye aur us se darguzar farmaiye. Allah Taala ne aapko wo nemat ata farma di jo ata farmaanii thi (aap ke Madina tashrif laney se pahley) is basti ke log is par muttafiq ho gaey they ke usey taaj pehna dein aur apna sardaar bana lin lekin jab Allah Taala ne us mansubey ko us haq ke zariey jo aapko us ne ata farmaya hai khatm kar diya to wo is par bigad gaya ye jo kuchh mamla us ne aap ke sath kya hai usi ka nateeja hai."
"5664","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri iyaadat ke liye tashrif laey aap na kisi khachchar par Sawar they na kisi ghodey par. ( balke aap paidal tashrif laey they)."
"5665","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere qareeb se guzrey aur main handi ke nichey aag sulgaa raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tumharey sar ki juwein tumhen takleef pahunchaatii hain. maine arz kya : ji haan! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hajjaam bulwaya aur us ne mera sar moond diya uske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey fidya ada kar dene ka hukm farmaayaa."
"5666","( sar ke shadeed dard ki wjah se) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : haaye rey sar ! is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar aisa meri zindagi mein ho gaya (yani tumhara intiqal ho gaya) to main tumharey liye istighfar aur dua karunga . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha afsos , Allah ki qism ! mera khayal hai ke aap mera mar jana hi pasand kartey hain aur agar aisa ho gaya to aap to isi din raat apni kisi biwi ke yahan guzaarengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya balke mein khud darde-sar mein mubtala hun. mera irada hota tha ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke betey ko bula bhejoon aur unhein (khilaafat ki) wasiiyat kar dun. kahin aisa na ho ke mere baad kehney waley kuchh aur kahein (ke khilafat hamara haq hai) ya aarzoo karne waley kisi aur baat ki aarzoo karein (ke ham khaleefa ho jaaein) phir maine apne ji mein kaha (iskii zarurat hi kya hai) khud Allah Taala Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa aur kisi ko khaleefa na honey dega na musalman aur kisi ki khilafat hi qabool karengey."
"5667","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aapko bukhar aaya hua tha maine aap ka jism chhu kar arz kya ke aapko bada tez bukhar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, tum mein ke 2 aadmiyon ke barabar hai. ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ajr bhi 2 guna hai. kaha haan phir aap ne farmaya ke kisi musalman ko bhi jab kisi marz ki takleef ya aur koi takleef pahunchti hai to Allah uske gunah ko is tarah jhaad deta hai jis tarah darakht apne patton ko jhaadtaa hai."
"5668","hamarey yahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri iyaadat ke liye tashrif laey main Hijjatul-wada ke zamane mein aik sakht bimari mein mubtala ho gaya tha maine arz kya ke meri bimari jis had ko pahunch chuki hai usey aap dekh rahe hain, main saahibe-daulat hun aur meri waaris meri sirf aik ladki ke siwa aur koi nahi, to kya main apna 2 tehai maal sadqa karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. maine arz kya phir aadha kar dun, aap ne farmaya ke nahi. maine arz kya aik tehai kar dun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tehai bahut kafi hai agar tum apne waarison ko ghanii chhod kar jao ye us se behtar hai ke unhein mohtaaj chhodo aur wo logon ke samney hath phailaatey phirein aur tum jo bhi kharch karogey aur us se Allah ki khushnoodii hasil karna maqsud hoga is par bhi tumhen sawab milega. yahan tak ke us luqma par bhi tumhen sawab milega jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein daltey ho."
"5669","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ka waqt qareeb aaya to ghar mein kai sahaba maujood they. umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) bhi wahin maujood they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke lao main tumharey liye aik tahreer likh dun taake iske baad tum ghalat raah par na chalo. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt sakht takleef mein hain aur tumharey paas Quran Majeed to maujood hai hii, hamarey liye Allah ki kitab kafi hai. us mas'ale par ghar mein maujood sahaba ka ikhtilaf ho gaya aur bahas karne lagey. kuchh sahaba kehtey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko (likhney ki cheezein ( de do taake Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisi tahreer likh dein jiske baad tum gumrah na ho sako aur kuchh sahaba wo kehtey they jo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tha. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ikhtilaf aur bahas badh gaee to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yahan se chaley jao. Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke sabse zyada afsos yahi hai ke unke ikhtilaf aur bahas ki wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo tahreer nahi likhi jo aap musalmanon ke liye likhnaa chahtey they."
"5670","mujhey meri khala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bachpan mein le gain aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! mere bhaanjey ko dard hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere sar par hath phera aur mere liye barkat ki dua ki phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya aur maine aap ke wuzu ka pani piyaa aur maine aap ki peeth ke peechhey khadey ho kar nabwooat ki mehar aap ke donon kandhon ke darmyan dekhi. ye mohare-nubuwat hajla uroos ki ghundii jaisi thi."
"5671","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi takleef mein agar koi shakhs mubtala ho to usey maut ki tamanna nahi karni chahiye aur agar koi maut ki tamanna karne hi lagey to ye kehna chaahiye ( اللهم أحيني ما كانت الحياة خيرا لي , Mina وتوفني إذا كانت الوفاة خيرا لي ( ''aey Allah ! jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar hai mujhey zinda rakh aur jab maut mere liye behtar ho to mujh ko utha ley.''"
"5672","ham Khabbaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan unki iyaadat ko gaey unhon-ne apne pet mein saat (7) dagh lagwaaey they phir unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey sathi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein wafat pa chukey wo yahan se is haal mein rukhsat huey ke duniya unka ajr w sawab kuchh na ghataa saki aur unke amal mein koi kami nahi hui aur ham ne (maal w daulat ( itni paai ke jiske kharch karne ke liye ham ne mitti ke siwa aur koi mahal nahi paya (lagey Imaaratein banwaaney) aur agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua karne se mana na kiya hota to main uski dua karta phir ham unki khidmat mein dobara hazir huey to wo apni diwar bana rahe they unhon-ne kaha musalman ko har us cheez par sawab milta hai jisey wo kharch karta hai magar is (kam bakht) Imaarat mein kharch karne ka sawab nahi milta ."
"5673","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kisi shakhs ka amal usey jannat mein dakhil nahi kar sakega. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ka bhi nahi ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya nahi, mera bhi nahi, siwa iske ke Allah apne Fazal w rehmat se mujhey nawaazey isliye (amal mein) miyaanaa rawii ikhtiyar karo aur qareeb-qareeb chalo aur tum mein koi shakhs maut ki tamanna na karey kyonke ya wo nek hoga to ummeed hai ke uske aamaal main aur izafa ho jaey aur agar wo bura hai to mumkin hai wo tauba hi kare."
"5674","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mera sahara liye huey they (marzul-maut mein) aur farma rahe they ( اللهم اغفر لي وارحمني وألحقني بالرفيق الأعلى ( ''aey Allaah! meri maghfirat farma mujh par raham kar aur mujh ko achchhey rafeeqon (farishton aur paighambaron) ke sath mila de. ''"
"5675","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi mareez ke paas tashrif ley jatey ya koi mareez aap ke paas laya jata to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua farmaatey أذهب الباس رب Naas ، Mina padhi. اشف وأنت الشافي لا شفاء إلا شفاؤك ، Mina padhi. شفاء لا يغادر سقما ''aey parwardigar logon ke ! bimari door kar de, aey insanon ke paalne waley ! shifa ata farma, to hi shifa dene wala hai. teri shifa ke siwa aur koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa de jis mein marz bilkul baqi na rahe.'' aur Amr bin abi Qais aur Ibrahim bin tahmaan ne Mansoor se bayan kya, unhon-ne Ibrahim aur abu zuhaa se ke ''jab koi mareez Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya jata. ''"
"5676","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey main bimar tha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya aur wuzu ka pani mujh par daala ya farmaya ke is par ye pani daal do, us se mujhey hosh aa gaya. maine arz kya ke main to kalaala hun (jiske walid aur aulad na ho) mere tarke mein taqseem kaisey hogi is par meeraas ki aayat nazil hui."
"5677","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hijrat karke Madina tashrif laey to Abu-Bakar aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko bukhar ho gaya. bayan kya ke phir main unke paas ( beemar pursi ke liye) gaee aur puchha ke mohtaram waalid! aap ka kya haal hai aur aey Bilal ! aap ka kya haal hai? bayan kya ke jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bukhar hota to wo ye sher padha kartey they. ''har shakhs apne ghar walon mein subah karta hai aur maut iske tasmey se bhi zyada qareeb hai''aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ka jab bukhar utartaa to buland awaz se wo ye ashaar padhtey. ''kaash mujhey malum hota ke main aik raat wadi (Makka) mein is tarah guzaar sakunga ke mere charon taraf izkhir aur Jaleel ( ghaas (ke darakht hongey aur kya kabhi phir main Mujanna ke ghaat par utar sakunga aur kya kabhi shaamma aur Tufail main apne samney dekh sakoonga.'' rawi ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq kaha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye dua farmaaii اللهم حبب إلينا المدينة كحبنا مكة أو أشد وصححها وبارك لنا في صاعها ومدها وانقل حماها فاجعلها بالجحفة''aey Allah ! hamarey dilon mein Madina ki mohabbat paida kar jaisa ke hamein (apne watan ( Makka ki mohabbat thi balke us se bhi zyada Madina ki mohabbat ata kar aur uski aab w hawa ko sihat bakhsh bana de aur hamarey liye iske saa aur mudd mein barkat ata farma aur uske bukhar ko kahin aur jagah muntaqil kar de usey Johfa ( naam ke gaaun ( mein bhej de. ''"
"5678","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne koi aisi bimari nahi utari jiski dawaa bhi nazil na ki ho."
"5679","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ghazawaat mein Sharik hoti thin aur musalman Mujahid ko pani pilaatii , unki khidmat kartin aur qatl honey walon aur zakhmiyon ko Madina Munawra laya kartii thin."
"5680","shifa teen chizon mein hai. shehad ke sharbat mein, pachhna lagwaaney main aur aag se daaghney mein lekin main ummat ko aag se dagh kar ilaaj karne se mana karta hun. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne is hadis ko marfooan naql kya hai aur al-qamii ne riwayat kya, unse Leis ne, unse Mujahid ne, unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shehad aur pachhna lagwaaney ke barey mein bayan kya."
"5681","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shifa teen chizon mein hai pachhna lagwaaney mein, shehad peeney main aur aag se daaghney mein magar main apni ummat ko aag se daaghney se mana karta hun."
"5682","mujhey Hisham ne khabar di, unhein unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meethaa aur shehad pasand tha."
"5683","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhari dawaaon mein kisi mein bhalai hai ya ye kaha ke tumhari (in) dawaaon mein bhalai hai. to pachhna lagwaaney ya shehad peeney aur aag se daaghney mein hai agar wo marz ke mutabiq ho aur main aag se daaghney ko pasand nahi karta hun."
"5684","aik sahib Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke mera bhai pet ki takleef mein mubtala hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein shehad pilaa, phir dusri martaba wahi sahabi hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey us martaba bhi shehad pilaaney ke liye kaha wo phir teesri martaba aaya aur arz kya ke) hukm ke mutabiq ( maine amal kya ( lekin shifa nahi huii). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala sachcha hai aur tumharey bhai ka pet jhoota hai, unhein phir shehad pilaa. chunanche unhon-ne shehad phir pilaya aur usi se wo tandurust ho gaya."
"5685","kuchh logon ko bimari thi, unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hamein qiyam ki jagah inayat farma dein aur hamarey khaney ka intizam kar dein phir jab wo log tandurust ho gaey to unhon-ne kaha ke Madina ki aab w hawa kharaab hai chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maqam Harra mein oonton ke sath unke qiyam ka intizam kar diya aur farmaya ke unka doodh piyo jab wo tandurust ho gaey to unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko haank kar ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke peechhey aadmi daudaaey aur wo pakdey gaey (jaisaa ke unhon-ne charwaahey ke sath kya tha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi waisaa hi kya unke haath-paaun katwaa diye aur unki aankhon mein salaaii phirwaa di. maine unmein se aik shakhs ko dekha ke zaban se zameen chaatta tha aur usi haalat mein wo mar gaya. salam ne bayan kya ke mujhey malum hua ke Hajjaj ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha tum mujh se wo sabse sakht saza bayan karo jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi ko di ho to unhon-ne yahi waqia bayan kya jab imam Hasan Basri tak ye baat pahunchi to unhon-ne kaha kash! wo ye hadis Hajjaj se na bayan kartey."
"5686","( Uraina ke) kuchh logon ko Madina Munawra ki aab w hua muwafiq nahi aai thi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke wo aap (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke charwaahey ke yahan chaley jayen yani oonton main aur unka doodh aur peshab piein. chunanche wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke charwaahey ke paas chaley gaey aur oonton ka doodh aur peshab piyaa jab wo tandurust ho gaey to unhon-ne charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko haank kar ley gaey. aapko jab iska ilm hua to aap ne unhein talash karne ke liye logon ko bheja jab unhein laya gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se unke bhi hath aur paon kaat diye gaey aur unki aankhon mein salaaii pher di gaee ( jaisa ke unhon-ne charwaahey ke sath kya tha) . Qatada ne bayan kya ke mujh se Muhammad-bin Sirin ne bayan kya ke ye hudood ke nazil honey se pahley ka waqia hai."
"5687","ham bahar gaey huey they aur hamarey sath ghalib bin-Abjar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. wo rasta mein bimar pad gaey phir jab ham Madina wapas aaey us waqt bhi wo bimar hi they. ibne-abi-Atiq unki iyaadat ke liye tashrif laey aur ham se kaha ke unhein ye kaley daney (kalonjii) istemal karaao, iske panch ya saat (7) daney lekar pees lo aur phir Zaitoon ke tel mein mila kar (naak ke) us taraf aur us taraf usey qatra qatra karke tapkaao. kyonke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne mujh se bayan kya ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye kalonjii har bimari ki dawaa hai siwa ( saam ( ke. maine arz kya ( saam ( kya hai? farmaya ke maut hai."
"5688","mujhey abu-Salma aur Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne khabar di aur unhein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke siyah daanon mein har bimari se shifa hai siwa ( saam ( ke. ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke) saam ( maut hai aur siyah daana kalonjii ko kehtey hain."
"5689","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bimar ke liye aur maiyat ke sogwaaron ke liye talbeena ( munasib , doodh aur shehad mila kar daliya ( pakaaney ka hukm deti thin aur farmati thin ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke talbeena mareez ke dil ko sukoon pahunchata hai aur gham ko door karta hai (kyonke usey peeney ke baad umuman neend aa jati hai ye Hazam karnewaalaa bhi hai)."
"5690","wo talbeena pakaaney ka hukm deti thin aur farmati thin ke agarche wo ( mareez ko) na-pasand hota hai lekin wo usko fayda deta hai."
"5691","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pachhna lagwaayaa aur pachhna lagaaney waley ko uski mazdoorii di aur naak mein dawaa dalwaaii ."
"5692","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum log is aud hindii ( كست (ka istemal kya karo kyonke usmein saat (7) beemaariyon ka ilaaj hai. halaq ke dard mein usey naak mein daala jata hai, paslii ke dard mein chabaaii jati hai."
"5693","aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne aik doodh-peetey ladkey ko lekar hazir hui phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uper us ne peshab kar diya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani mangwa kar peshab ki jagah par chhinta diya."
"5694","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (eik martaba ( roze ki haalat mein pachhna lagwaayaa ."
"5695","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pachhna lagwaayaa jabke aap ehram se they."
"5696","unse pachhna lagwaaney waley ki mazdoorii ke barey mein puchha gaya tha. unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pachhna lagwaayaa tha aapko abu-Taiba ( Naafe ya Maisra ( ne pachhna lagaya tha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein do saa khajoor mazdoorii mein di thi aur aap ne unke maalikon ( banu- Harisa ( se guftgu ki to unhon-ne unse wsool kiye janey waley lagaan mein kami kar di thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (khoon ke dabaaw ka ( behtreen ilaaj jo tum kartey ho wo pachhna lagwaanaa hai aur umda dawaa aud hindii ka istemal karna hai aur farmaya apne bachchon ko) عذرة ( (halaq ki beemaarii) mein unka taaloo daba kar takleef mat do balke (kust) laga do us se waram jata rahega."
"5697","Jabir-bin-Abdullah miqna-bin-Sanaan Taabai ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif laey phir unse kaha ke jab tak tum pachhna na lagwaa logey mein yahan se nahi jaunga, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usmein shifa hai."
"5698","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makka ke rastey mein maqam Luhiy-jamal main apne sar ke beech mein pachhna lagwaayaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt ehram ki haalat mein they."
"5699","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa."
"5700","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne haalate-ehraam main apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa (ye pachhna aap ne sar ke) dard ki wjah se lagwaayaa tha jo Luhyi-jamal naam ke pani ke ghaat par aapko ho gaya tha."
"5701","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat main apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa . aadhey sar ke dard ki wjah se jo aapko ho gaya tha."
"5702","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhari dawaaiyon mein koi bhalai hai to shehad ke sharbat mein hai aur pachhna lagwaaney mein hai aur aag se daaghney mein hai lekin main aag se dagh kar ilaaj ko pasand nahi karta."
"5703","suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey mein aik handi ke nichey aag jalaa raha tha aur juwein mere sar se gir rahi thi (aur mein ehram baandhey huey tha) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke sar ki ye juwein tumhen takleef pahunchaatii hain? maine arz kya ke ji haan. farmaya ke phir sar mundwaa ley aur (kaffaare ke taur par) teen din ke rozey rakh ya chh miskinon ko khana khilaa ya aik qurbani kar de. Ayub ne kaha ke mujhey yad nahi ke (un teen chizon mein se) kis ka zikr sabse pahley kya tha."
"5704","maine Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhari dawaaon mein shifa hai to pachhna lagwaaney aur aag se daaghney mein hai lekin aag se dagh kar ilaaj ko main pasand nahi karta."
"5705","nazare-bd aur zahreeley janwar ke kaat khaney ke siwa aur kisi cheez par jhaad phoonk sahi nahi. (haseen ne bayan kya ke) phir maine iska zikr Saeed-bin-Jubair se kya to unhon-ne bayan kya ke ham se Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere samney tamam ummatein pesh ki gain eik-eik, 2-2 Nabi aur unke sath unke manney waley guzartey rahe aur kuchh Nabi aisey bhi they ke unke sath koi nahi tha aakhir mere samney aik badi bhari jamat aai. maine puchha ye kon hain, kya ye meri ummat ke log hain? kaha gaya ke ye Musa (Alaihissalam) aur unki qaum hai phir kaha gaya ke kinaron ki taraf dekho maine dekha ke aik bahut hi azeem jamat hai jo kinaron par chhaaii hui hai phir mujh se kaha gaya ke idhar dekho, idhar dekho aasman ke mukhtalif kinaron mein maine dekha ke jamat hai jo tamam ufuq par chhaaii hui hai. kaha gaya ke ye aap ki ummat hai aur is mein se 70 hazaar hisab ke baghair jannat mein dakhil kar diye jaengey. iske baad aap (apne hujre mein) tashrif le gaey aur kuchh tafseel nahi farmai log un jannatiyon ke barey mein bahas karne lagey aur kehney lagey ke ham Allah par eman laey hain aur uske rasool ki ittaba (pairvi) ki hai, isliye ham hi (sahaaba) wo log hain ya hamari wo aulad hain jo Islam mein paida huey kyonke ham jahiliyat mein paida huey they. ye baatein jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko malum huin to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya ke ye wo log hongey jo jhaad-phoonk nahi karaatey, faal nahi dekhtey aur dagh kar ilaaj nahi kartey balke apne rab par bharosa kartey hain. is par Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya main bhi unmein se hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. iske baad doosrey sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main bhi unmein hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha tum se bazi ley gaey."
"5706","aik aurat ke shauhar ka intiqal ho gaya (iddat key zamaane mein) us aurat ki aankh dukhney lagi to logon ne iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya. un logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney surme ka zikr kya aur ye ke (agar surma aankh mein na lagaya to ( unki aankh ke mutaalliq khatrah hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) zamana jahiliyat mein) iddat guzarney wali tum aurton ke apne ghar mein sabse badtar kapdey mein padaa rehna padta tha ya (aap ne ye farmaya ke) apne kapdon mein ghar ke sabse badtar hisse mein padaa rehna padta tha phir jab koi kutta guzarta to is par wo mengni phenk kar maartii ( tab iddat se bahar hoti ( to char mahiney das din tak surma na lagaao ."
"5707","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot lagna, badshigoonii lenaa, ulloo ka manhoos hona aur safar ka manhoos hona ye sab bekaar khayalat hain albatta juzaamii shakhs se aisey bhaagta reh jaisey ke sher se bhaagta hai."
"5708","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khumbii ( من ( mein se hai aur iska pani aankh ke liye shifa hai. isi sanad se Shoba ne bayan kya ke mujhey Hakam-bin-Utaibaa ne khabar di, unhein Hasan-bin- Abdullah arnii ne, unhein Amr-bin-Hurais ne aur unhein Saeed-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hadis bayan ki, Shoba ne kaha ke jab Hakam ne bhi mujh se ye hadis bayan kar di to phir abdul-Malik-bin-Umair ki riwayat par mujh ko aitimad ho gaya kyonke Abdul-Malik ka haafiza aakhir mein bigad gaya tha Shoba ko sirf uski riwayat par bharosa na raha."
"5709","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laash Mubarak ko bosa diya."
"5710","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laash Mubarak ko bosa diya."
"5711","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laash Mubarak ko bosa diya."
"5712","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke marz ( wafat ( mein dawaa aap ke munh mein dali to aap ne hamein ishara kya ke dawaa munh mein na dalo ham ne khayal kya ke mareez ko dawaa se jo nafrat hoti hai uski wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mana farma rahe hain phir jab aapko hosh hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kyon maine tumhen mana nahi kya tha ke dawaa mere munh mein na daalo. ham ne arz kya ke ye shayad aap ne mareez ki dawaa se tabae nafrat ki wjah se farmaya hoga. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab ghar mein jitney log is waqt maujood hain sab ke munh mein dawaa dali jaey aur main dekhta rahoonga, albatta Abbas ko chhod diya jaey kyonke wo mere munh mein daltey waqt maujood na they, baad mein aaey."
"5713","main apne aik ladkey ko lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui. maine uski naak mein battii dali thi, iska halaq dabaayaa tha chunkey usko galey ki bimari ho gaee thi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum apne bachchon ko ungli se halaq daba kar kyon takleef deti ho ye aud hindii lo ismein saat (7) beemaariyon ki shifa hai unmein aik zaatul-janb (paslii ka waram bhi hai) agar halaq ki bimari ho to usko naak mein dalo agar zaatul-janb ho to halaq mein daalo. Sufiyan kehtey hain ke maine Zohri se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 beemaariyon ko to bayan kya baqi panch beemaariyon ko bayan nahi farmaya, Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne kaha maine Sufiyan se kaha, Mamar to Zohri se yun naql karta hai) أعلقت عنه ( unhon-ne kaha ke Mamar ne yad nahi rakha. mujhey yad hai Zohri ne yun kaha tha ( أعلقت عليه‏) aur Sufiyan ne us tehneek ko bayan kya, jo bachche ko paidaaish ke waqt ki jati hai. Sufiyan ne ungli halaq mein daal kar apne koey ko ungli se uthaya to Sufiyan ne ( أعلاق (ka mana bachchey ke halaq mein ungli daal kar taaloo ko uthaya unhon-ne ye nahi kaha ( أعلقوا عنه شيئا‏)."
"5714","mujh ko Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba ne khabar di aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke jab (marzul-maut mein) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye chalnaa phirnaa dushwar ho gaya aur aap ki takleef badh gaee to aap ne bimari ke din mere ghar mein guzarney ki ijazat apni dusri beeviyon se maangii. jab ijazat mil gaee to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 logon, Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) aur aik sahib ke darmyan unka sahara lekar bahar tashrif laaey, aap ke Mubarak qadam zameen par ghisat rahe they. maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se iska zikr kya to unhon-ne kaha tumhen malum hai wo doosrey sahib kon they jinka Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne naam nahi bataya, maine kaha ke nahi kaha ke wo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) they. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke unke hujrey mein dakhil honey ke baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jabke aap ka marz badh gaya tha ke mujh par saat (7) mashk dalo jo pani se labrez hun. shayad mein logon ko kuchh nasihat kar sakun . bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ham ne aik lagan mein bithaya jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ka tha aur aap par hukm ke mutabiq mashkon se pani dalney lagey aakhir aap ne hamein ishara kya ke bas ho chukaa. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba ke majme' mein gaey, unhein Namaz padhai aur unhein Khattab farmaayaa."
"5715","umme-Qais binte- Mohsin Asadiya ne unhein khabar di, unka talluq qabila Khuzaima ki shaakh-bin-Asad se tha wo un shuruati muhaajaraat mein se thin jinhoney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki thi. aap Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) ki behan hain (unhon-ne bayan kya ke) wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne aik betey ko lekar aaein. unhon-ne apne ladkey ke) عذرة (ka ilaaj taaloo daba kar kya tha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aakhir tum auratein kyon apni aulad ko yun taaloo daba kar takleef pahunchaatii ho. tumhen chahiye ke us marz mein aud hindii ka istemal kya karo kyonke usmein saat (7) beemaariyon se shifa hai. unmein aik zaatul-janb ki bimari bhi hai. (aud hindii se) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad ( كست ( thi yahi aud hindii hai. aur Yunus aur Ishaq bin Rashid ne bayan kya aur unse Zohri ne is riwayat mein bajaey ( اعلقت عليه‏ . Mina ( ke) علقت عليه‏ . Mina ( naql kya hai."
"5716","aik sahib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke mere bhai ko dast aa rahe hain Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein shehad pulaaw. unhon-ne pilaya aur phir wapas aa kar kaha ke maine unhein shehad pilaya lekin unke daston mein koi kami nahi hui. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke Allah Taala ne sach farmaya aur tumharey bhai ka pet jhoota hai (aakhir shehad hi se usey shifa hui) Muhammad-bin-Jafar ke sath us hadis ko Nazar-bin-Shumail ne bhi Shoba se riwayat kya hai."
"5717","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, beemaariyon mein chhoot-chhaat safar aur ulloo ki nahoosat ki koi asl nahi is par aik dehati bola ke ya Rasulullah! phir mere oonton ko kya ho gaya ke wo jab tak registaan mein rahtey hain to hirnon ki tarah (saaf aur khub chikney) rahtey hain phir unmein aik khaarish wala oont aa jata hai aur unmein ghus kar unhein bhi khaarish laga jata hai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya lekin ye bataao ke pahley oont ko kis ne khaarish lagai thi? uski riwayat Zohri ne abu-Salma aur Sanan bin Sanan ke waaste se ki hai."
"5718","Umme- Qais binte- Mohsin jo pahley pahal hijrat karne wali aurton mein se thin jinhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki thi aur wo ukaasha-bin-mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) ki behan thin, khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne betey ko lekar hazir huin. unhon-ne us bachchey ka kowa girney mein taaloo daba kar ilaaj kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah se daro ke tum apni aulad ko is tarah taaloo daba kar takleef pahunchaatii ho aud hindii (koot) usmein istemal karo kyonke usmein saat (7) beemaariyon ke liye shifa hai jin mein se aik nimooniya bhi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad aud hindii se ( كست ( thi jisey ( qist ( bhi kehtey hain ye bhi aik lughat hai."
"5719","Ayub sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa tha."
"5720","Ayyoob sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa thaa."
"5721","Ayyoob sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa thaa."
"5722","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar par (Uhud ke din) khud toot gaya aap ka Mubarak chehra khoon aalud ho gaya aur samney ke daant toot gaey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) dhaal bhar-bhar kar pani latey they aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aap ke chehra Mubarak se khoon dho rahi thin. phir jab Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne dekha ke khoon pani se bhi zyada aa raha hai to unhon-ne aik boriyaa jalaa kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zakhmon par lagaya aur us se khoon ruka ."
"5723","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bukhaar jahannam ki bhap mein se hai to uski garmi ko pani se bujhaao.'' Naafe ne bayan kya ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) (ko jab bukhar aata to) yun dua kartey ke ''Allah ! ham se us azab ko door kar de.''"
"5724","Asma binte-abii-bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan jab koi bukhar mein mubtala aurat laai jati thi to wo uske liye dua kartin aur uske garebaan mein pani daaltiin wo bayan karti thin ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya tha ke bukhar ko pani se thanda karein."
"5725","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bukhaar jahannam ki bhap mein se hai isliye usey pani se thanda karo.''"
"5726","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bukhaar jahannam ki bhap mein se hai, to usey pani se thanda kar liya karo."
"5727","qabila ukul aur Uraina ke kuchh log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Islam ke barey mein guftgu ki. unhon-ne kaha ke aey Allah ke Nabi ! ham maweshii waley hain ham log ahale-Madeena ki tarah kisaan nahi hain. Madina ki aab w hua unhein muwafiq nahi aai thi, chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye chand oonton aur aik charwaahey ka hukm diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo log un oonton ke sath bahar chaley jayen aur unka doodh aur peshab piein. wo log chaley gaey lekin Harra ke nazdeek pahunch kar wo Islam se murtad ho gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke charwaahey ko qatl kar daala aur oonton ko lekar bhag padey jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar mili to aap ne unki talash mein aadmi daudaaey phir aap ne unke mutaalliq hukm diya aur unki aankhon mein salaaii pher di gaee, unke hath kaat diye gaey aur Harra ke kinarey unhein chhod diya gaya, wo usi haalat mein mar gaey."
"5728","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum sun lo ke kisi jagah taaoon ki wabaa phail rahi hai to wahan mat jao lekin jab kisi jagah ye wabaa phoot padey aur tum wahin maujood ho to us jagah se niklo bhi mat. (habeeb bin abi Sabit ne bayan kya ke maine Ibrahim bin Sad se) kaha tum ne khud ye hadis Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se suni hai ke unhon-ne Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya aur unhon-ne iska inkar nahi kya? farmaya ke haan."
"5729","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Sham (Syria) tashrif ley ja rahe they jab aap maqam sargh par pahunchey to aap ki mulaqat faujon ke ameeron abu-Ubaida-bin-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) aur aap ke sathiyon se hui. un logon ne ameerul-momineen ko bataya ke taaoon ki wabaa Sham (Syria) mein phoot padi hai. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mere paas muhaajireene-awwaleen ko bula laao. aap unhein bula laey to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse mashwara kya aur unhein bataya ke Sham (Syria) mein taaoon ki wabaa phoot padi hai, muhajireen awwaleen ki raayein mukhtalif ho gaiin. kuchh logon ne kaha ke sahaba Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathiyon ki baqi bachi jamat aap ke sath hai aur ye munasib nahi hai ke aap unhein us wabaa mein daal dein. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke achchha ab aap log tashrif ley jayen phir farmaya ke Ansar ko bulao . main Ansar ko bula kar laya aap ne unse bhi mashwara kya aur unhon-ne bhi muhajireen ki tarah ikhtilaf kya koi kehney laga chalo, koi kehney laga lot jao. ameerul-momineen ne farmaya ke ab aap log bhi tashrif ley jayen phir farmaya ke haan, par jo Quraish ke badey boodhey hain jo fateh Makka ke waqt Islam qabool karke Madina aaey they unhein bula laao, main unhein bula kar laya. un logon mein koi ikhtilaf raey paida nahi hua sab ne kaha ke hamara khayal hai ke aap logon ko sath lekar wapas lot chalein aur wabaaii mulk mein logon ko na lekar jaaein. ye suntey hi umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne logon mein elaan kara diya ke main subah ko oont par Sawar ho kar wapas Madina Munawra lot jaaunga tum log bhi wapas chalo. subah ko aisa hi hua abu-Ubaida ibne- Jarrah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kya Allah ki taqdeer se faraar ikhtiyar kya jaeyga umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kash! ye baat kisi aur ne kahi hoti haan ham Allah ki taqdeer se faraar ikhtiyar kar rahe hain lekin Allah hi ki taqdeer ki taraf. kya tumharey paas oont hun aur tum unhein lekar kisi aisi wadi mein jao jiske 2 kinarey hon aik sar-sabz shaadaab aur doosra khushk. kya ye waqia nahi ke agar tum sar-sabz kinarey par charaaogey to wo bhi Allah ki taqdeer se hoga aur khushk kinarey par charaaogey to wo bhi Allah ki taqdeer se hi hoga. bayan kya ke phir Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) aagey wo apni kisi zarurat ki wjah se us waqt maujood nahi they unhon-ne bataya ke mere paas masla se mutaalliq aik ilm hai. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum kisi sar zameen main (wabaa ke mutaalliq) suno to wahan na jao aur jab aisi jagah wabaa aa jaey jahan tum khud maujood ho to wahan se mat niklo. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Allah Taala ki hamd ki aur phir wapas ho gaey."
"5730","umr (Raziallahu anhu) Sham (Syria) ke liye rawaana huey jab maqam Sargh mein pahunchey to aapko khabar mili ke Sham (Syria) mein taaoon ki wabaa phoot padi hai. phir Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum wabaa ke mutaalliq suno ke wo kisi jagah hai to wahan na jao aur jab kisi aisi jagah wabaa phoot padey jahan tum maujood ho to wahan se bhi mat bhaago (wabaa mein taaoon, haiza wghaira sab dakhil hain)."
"5731","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Madina Munawra mein dajjal dakhil nahi ho sakega aur na taaoon aa sakega.''"
"5732","Yahya bin Sirin ka kis bimari mein intiqal hua tha. maine kaha ke taaoon mein, bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke taaoon har musalman ke liye shahadat hai."
"5733","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pet ki bimari mein yani haize se marney wala Shahid hai aur taaoon ki bimari mein marney wala Shahid hai."
"5734","aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taaoon ke mutaalliq poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye aik azab tha Allah Taala jis par chahta is par usko bhejta tha phir Allah Taala ne usey momineen (ummat muhammadiya ke liye) rehmat bana diya ab koi bhi Allah ka banda agar sabr ke sath us Shahar mein thehra rahe jahan taaoon phoot padaa ho aur yaqin rakhta hai ke jo kuchh Allah Taala ne uske liye likh diya hai uske siwa usko aur koi nuqsan nahi pahunch sakta aur phir taaoon mein iska intiqal ho jaey to usey Shahid jaisa sawab milega. Hibban bin halal ke sath us hadis ko Nazar-bin-Shumail ne bhi Dawud se riwayat kya hai."
"5735","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne maut ke marz main apne uper muawwizaat ( sura Ikhlas , sura Falaq aur sura Naas (ka dam kya kartey they. phir jab aap ke liye dushwar ho gaya to main unka dam aap par kya karti thi aur barkat ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hath aap ke jism Mubarak par bhi pher leti thi. phir maine iske mutaalliq puchha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kis tarah dam kartey they, unhon-ne bataya ke apne hath par dam karke hath ko chehrey par phera kartey they."
"5736","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand sahaba dar-haalate-safar Arab ke aik qabeele par guzrey. qabeele walon ne unki ziyaafat nahi ki kuchh der baad us qabeele ke sardaar ko bichhu ne kaat liya, ab qabeele walon ne un sahaba se kaha ke aap logon ke paas koi dawaa ya koi jhadney wala hai. sahaba ne kaha ke tum logon ne hamein mehman nahi banaya aur ab ham us waqt tak dam nahi karengey jab tak tum hamarey liye uski mazdoorii na muqarrar kar do. chunanche un logon ne chand bakriyan deeni manzoor kar lin phir (abu-Saeed Khudri (rz)) sura Fatiha padhney lagey aur is par dam karne mein munh ka thook bhi us jagah par dalney lagey. us se wo shakhs achchha ho gaya. chunanche qabeele waley bakriyan lekar aaey lekin sahaba ne kaha ke jab tak ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se na poochh lein ye bakriyan nahi ley saktey phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to aap muskuraaey aur farmaya tumhen kaisey malum ho gaya tha ke sura Fatiha se dam bhi kya ja sakta hai, un bakriyon ko ley lo aur is mein mera bhi hissey lagaao."
"5737","chand sahaba aik pani se guzrey jiske paas ke qabeele mein bichho ka kaataa hua aik shakhs tha. qabeele ka aik shakhs unke paas aaya aur kaha kya aap logon mein koi dam jhaad karne wala hai. hamarey qabeele mein aik shakhs ko bichhu ne kaat liya hai chunanche sahaba ki us jamat mein se aik sahabi us shakhs ke sath gaey aur chand bakriyon ki shart ke sath us shakhs par sura Fatiha padhi, us se wo achchha ho gaya wo sahib shart ke mutabiq bakriyan apne sathiyon ke paas laey to unhon-ne usey qabool kar lena pasand nahi kya aur kaha ke Allah ki kitab par tum ne ujrat ley li. aakhir jab sab log Madina aaey to arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! un sahib ne Allah ki kitab par ujrat ley li hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jin chizon par tum ujrat ley saktey ho unmein se zyada uski mustahiq Allah ki kitab hi hai."
"5738","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya ya (aap ne is tarah bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) hukm diya ke nazare-bad lag janey par muawwizatain se dam kar liya jaey."
"5739","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke ghar mein aik ladki dekhi jiske chehrey par (nazare-bad lagney ki wjah se) kaley dhabbey pad gaey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par dam kara do kyonke usey nazare-bd lag gaee hai. aur Aqeel ne kaha unse Zohri ne, unhein Urwa ne khabar di aur unhon-ne usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mursalan riwayat kya hai. Muhammad-bin-harab ke sath us hadis ko Abdullaah-bin-Saalim ne bhi Zubaidi se riwayat kya hai."
"5740","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nazare-bad lagna haq hai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jism par godney se mana farmaayaa."
"5741","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se zahreeley janwar ke kaatney mein jhadney ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke har zahreeley janwar ke kaatney mein jhadney ki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat di hai."
"5783","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala uski taraf qiyamat ke din nazar rehmat nahi karega jo apna kapda takabbur w ghurur se zameen par ghaseet kar chalta hai.''"
"5784","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs takabbur ki wjah se tehband ghaseet'taa hua chalega to Allah paak uski taraf qiyamat ke din nazar bhi nahi karega.'' Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! mere tahmad ka aik hissey kabhi latak jata hai magar ye ke khas taur se iska khayal rakha karun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum un logon mein se nahi ho jo aisa takabbur se kartey hain.''"
"5785","suraj girahan hua to ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. aap jaldi mein kapda ghaseet'tey huey masjid mein tashrif laaey, log bhi jama ho gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakaat Namaz padhai, girahan khatm ho gaya, tab aap hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ''sooraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain isliye jab tum un nishaniyon mein se koi nishani dekho to Namaz padho aur Allah se dua karo yahan tak ke wo khatm ho jaaey.''"
"5786","phir maine dekha ke Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) aik neza lekar aaey aur usey zameen mein gaad diya phir Namaz ke liye takbeer kahi gaee. maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik joda pahney huey bahar tashrif laey jisey aap ne samet rakha tha. phir aap ne neze ke samney khadey ho kar do rakaat namaaze-eid padhai aur maine dekha ke insan aur janwar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney neze ke bahar ki taraf se guzar rahe they."
"5787","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tehband ka jo hissey takhnon se nichey latkaa ho wo jahannam mein hoga.''"
"5788","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs apna tahmad ghurur ki wjah se ghaseet'taa hai, Allah Taala qiyamat ke din uski taraf dekhega nahi. ''"
"5789","Nabi ya (ye bayan kya ke) abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(banii-Israaeel mein) aik shakhs aik joda pahan kar kibr w ghurur mein sar mast, sar ke baalon mein kanghi kiye huey akad kar itraataa ja raha tha ke Allah Taala ne usey zameen mein dhansaa diya ab wo qiyamat tak usmein tadaptaa rahega ya dhanstaa rahega.''"
"5790","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik shakhs ghurur mein apna tahmad ghaseet'taa hua chal raha tha ke usey zameen mein dhansaa diya gaya aur wo isi tarah qiyamat tak zameen mein dhanstaa hi rahega.'' uski mutabiat (pairavi) Yunus ne Zohri se ki hai, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, usey marfooan nahi bayan kya."
"5791","maine mahaarib-bin-dassaar qazi se mulaqat ki, wo ghodey par Sawar they aur makan adaalat mein aa rahe they jis mein wo faisla kya kartey they. maine unse yahi hadis poochhi to unhon-ne mujh se bayan kya, kaha ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo aap apna kapda ghurur ki wjah se ghaseet'taa hua chalega, qiyamat ke din uski taraf Allah Taala nazar nahi karega.'' (Shoba ne kaha ke) maine Maharib se puchha kya ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne tahmad ka zikr kya tha? unhon-ne farmaya ke tahmad ya qamees kisi ki unhon-ne takhsees nahi ki thi. Maharib ke sath us hadis ko jabla bin Saheem aur Zaid-bin-Aslam aur Zaid bin-Abdullah ne bhi Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. aur Leis ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aisi hi riwayat ki aur Naafe ke sath usko Musa-bin-Aqba aur Umar-bin Muhammad aur Qudama bin-Musa ne bhi Salim se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki usmein yun hai ke jo shakhs apna kapda ( az-raah takabbur ( latkaaey."
"5792","Rifaa Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein . main bhi baithi hui thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! main Rifaa ke nikah mein thi lekin unhon-ne mujhey teen talaaq de di hain. ( mughalliza ( . iske baad maine Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar liya aur Allah ki qism ke unke sath ya Rasulullah! sirf is jhaalar jaisa hai. unhon-ne apni chadar ke jhaalar ko apne hath mein lekar ishara kya. Khaalid-bin-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) jo darwazey par khadey they aur unhein abhi andar aaney ki ijazat nahi hui thi, usne bhi unki baat suni. bayan kya ke Khalid (Raziallahu anhu)) wahin se) boley Abu-Bakar ! aap us aurat ko roktey nahi ke kis tarah ki baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney khol kar bayan karti hai lekin Allah ki qism is baat par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tabassum aur badh gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke ghaaliban tum dobara Rifaa ke paas jana chahti ho? lekin aisa us waqt tak mumkin nahi jab tak wo ( tumharey doosrey shauhar Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber ( tumhara mazaa na chakh lein aur tum unka mazaa na chakh lo phir baad mein yahi qanoon bin gaya."
"5793","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya (ke Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ne sharab ke haram honey se pahley sharab ke nashe mein jab unki ontni zabah kar di aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aa kar uski shikayat ki to ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni chadar mangwai aur usey odh kar tashrif ley chalney lagey. main aur Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke peechhey peechhey they. aakhir aap us ghar mein pahunchey jis mein Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) they, aap ne andar aaney ki ijazat mangi aur unhon-ne aap hazraat ko ijazat di."
"5794","aik sahib ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram waala shakhs kis tarah ka kapda pahney. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ehram wala shakhs qamees, paa-jaama, barans ( topii ya sar par pahnney ki koi cheez (aur mozey nahi pahnega albatta agar usey chappal na milein to mozon hi ko takhnon tak kaat kar pahan ley wo hi jootii ki tarah ho jaengey."
"5795","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abdullah-bin-Ubai (munaafiq) ke paas jab usey qabr mein dakhil kya ja chuka tha tashrif laey phir aap ke hukm se uski laash nikaalii gaee aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghutnon par usey rakha gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par dam kartey huey apni qamees pahnaaii aur Allah hi khub jaanney wala hai."
"5796","jab Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki wafat hui to iske ladkey ( Abdullah ( jo mukhlis aur akaabir sahaba mein they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! apni qamees mujhey ata farmaiye taake main apne bap ko iska kafan dun aur aap unki namaaze-janaaza padha dein aur unke liye duaaey maghfirat karein chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qamees unhein ata farmai aur farmaya ke nehlaa-dhulaa kar mujhey itlaa dena. chunanche jab nehlaa-dhulaa liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko itlaa di Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey taake uski namaaze-janaaza padhaaein lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko pakad liya aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya Allah Taala ne aapko munaafeqeen par namaaze-janaaza padhney se mana nahi farmaya hai? aur farmaya hai استغفر لهم أو لا تستغفر لهم إن تستغفر لهم سبعين Murra فلن يغفر الله لهم ke ''unke liye maghfirat ki dua karo ya maghfirat ki dua na karo agar tum 70 martaba bhi unke liye maghfirat ki dua karogey tab bhi Allah unhein hargiz nahi bakhsheyga.'' phir ye aayat nazil huii ولا تصل على أحد منهم مات أبدا ke ''aur unmein se kisi par bhi jo mar gaya ho hargiz Namaz na padhiye.'' iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki namaaze-janaaza padhni chhod di."
"5797","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kanjoos aur sadqa dene waley ki misal bayan kya ke 2 aadmiyon jaisi hai jo lohey ke jubbey haath, Sina aur halaq tak pahney huey hain. sadqa dene wala jab bhi sadqa karta hai to iske jubbe mein kushadgi ho jati hai aur wo uski ungliyon tak badh jata hai aur qadam ke nishanat ko dhak leta hai aur kanjoos jab bhi kabhi sadqe ka irada karta hai to uska jubba usey aur chimat jata hai aur har halqa apni jagah par jam jata hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is tarah apni Mubarak ungliyon se apne garebaan ki taraf ishara karke bata rahe they ke tum dekhogey ke wo usmein wusat paida karna chaahega lekin wusat paida nahi hogi. iski mutabiat (pairavi) ibne-Taaoos ne apne walid se ki hai aur abu-Zinaad ne Aaraj se ki '' 2 jubbon'' ke zikr ke sath aur Hanzala ne bayan kya ke maine Taaus se suna, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha (جبتان) aur Jafar ne Aaraj ke waaste se ( جبتان‏ . Mina (ka lafz bayan kya hai."
"5798","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qazaey-hajat ke liye bahar tashrif le gaey phir wapas aaey to main pani lekar hazir tha. aap ne wuzu kya aap shaami jubba pahney huey they, aap ne kulli ki aur naak mein pani daala aur apna chehra dhoya phir apni aasteenein chadhaaney lagey lekin wo tang thi isliye aap ne apne hath jubbe ke nichey se nikaley aur unhein dhoya aur sar par aur mozon par masah kya."
"5799","mein aik raat safar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha aap ne malum farmaya tumharey paas pani hai? maine arz kya ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari se utrey aur chaltey rahe yahan tak ke raat ki taareeki mein aap chhup gaey phir wapas tashrif laey to maine bartan ka pani aapko istemal karaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna chehra dhoya, hath dhoey aap oon ka jubba pahney huey they jiski aasteen chadhai aap ke liye dushwar thi chunanche aap ne apne hath jubba ke nichey se nikaley aur baazuon ko (kohniyon tak) dhoya. phir sar par masah kya phir main badha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mozey utaar dun lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke rehney do maine tahaarat ke baad unhein pehna tha chunanche aap ne un par masah kya."
"5800","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand qubaaein taqseem kiin aur Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ko kuchh nahi diya to Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha betey hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley chalo chunanche main apne walid ko sath lekar chalaa, unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke andar jao aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mera zikr kar do. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ka zikr kya to aap bahar tashrif laey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein qubaaon mein se aik Quba liye huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye maine tumharey hi liye rakh chhodi thi. Miswar ne bayan kya ke Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Makhrima khush ho gaey."
"5801","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko resham ki furooj (Qubaa) hadiya mein di gaee. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pehna (resham ka mardon ke liye hurmat ke hukm se pahley) aur usi ko pahney huey Namaz padhi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey badi tezi ke sath utaar daala jaisey aap us se na-gawari mehsus kartey hon phir farmaya ke ye muttaqiyon ke liye munasib nahi hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Abdullah-bin Yusuf ne ki unse Leis ne aur Abdullah-bin Yusuf ke ilawa dusron ne kaha ke (furooj hareer)."
"5802","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) par reshamii zard topii ko dekha."
"5803","aik shakhs ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram wala shakhs kis tarah ka kapda pahney? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (mohrim ke liye) ke qamees na pahno, na amaamey, na paajaamey, na barans aur na mozey albatta agar kisi ko chappal na miley to wo (chamdey ke) mozon ko takhna se nichey tak kaat kar unhein pahan sakta hai aur na koi aisa kapda pahno jis mein zafran ya waras lagaya gaya ho."
"5804","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ke barey mein) farmaya ''jisey tahmad na miley wo paa-jaama pahney aur jisey chappal na milein wo mozey pahnein.''"
"5805","aik sahib ne khadey ho kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram baandhney ke baad hamein kis cheez ke pahnney ka hukm hai? farmaya ke qamees na pahno, na paajaamey, na amaamey, na barans aur na mozey pahno. albatta agar kisi ke paas chappal na hon to wo chamdey ke aisey mozey pahney jo takhnon se nichey hon aur koi aisa kapda na pahno jis mein zafran aur waras laga hua ho."
"5806","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) qamees na pahney, na amama pahney, na paa-jaama, na barans aur na koi aisa kapda pahney jis mein zafran aur waras laga ho aur na mozey pahney albatta agar kisi ko chappal na milein to mozon ko takhnon ke nichey tak kaat de ( phir pahney ( ."
"5807","bahut se musalman Habsha hijrat karke chaley gaey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi hijrat ki taiyaariyaan karne lagey lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi thahar jao kyonke mujhey bhi ummeed hai ke mujhey ( hijrat ki) ijazat di jaeygi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : kya aapko bhi ummeed hai? mera bap aap par qurbaan . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. chunanche Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rehney ke khayal se ruk gaey aur apni 2 oontniyon ko babool ke pattey khilaa kar char mahiney tak unhein khub taiyaar kartey rahe. Urwa ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ham aik din do-pahar ke waqt apne ghar mein baithey huey they ke aik shakhs ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sar dhakey huey tashrif la rahe hain. us waqt aam taur se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif nahi latey they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha mere maan-baap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par qurbaan hon, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisey waqt kisi wjah hi se tashrif la saktey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne makan par pahunch kar ijazat chahi aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein ijazat di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur andar dakhil hotey hi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke jo log tumharey paas is waqt hain unhein utha do Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha mera bap aap par qurbaan ho ya Rasulullah ! ye sab aap ke ghar hi ke afraad hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey hijrat ki ijazat mil gaee hai. Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir ya Rasulullah ! mujhey sath rehney ki khushnasibi hasil rahegi? aap ne farmaya ke haan. kaha ya Rasulullah ! mere bap aap par qurbaan hon un do oontniyon mein se aik aap ley lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin qeemat se. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir ham ne bahut jaldi jaldii saamaane-safar taiyaar kya aur safar ka naashta aik thailey mein rakha. Asma binte abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne patkey ke aik tukdey se thailey ke munh ko baandhaa. isi wjah se unhein ''zaatun-nitaaq'' (patkey waali) kehney lagey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) saur naam ke pahaad ki aik ghaar mein ja kar chhup gaey aur teen din tak usi mein thahrey rahe. Abdullah-bin abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) raat aap hazraat ke paas hi guzaartey they. wo naujawaan zaheen aur samajhdaar they. subah tadkey mein wahan se chal detey they aur subah hotey hotey Makka ke Quraish mein pahunch jatey they. jaisey raat main Makka hi mein rahe hun. Makka Mukarrama mein jo baat bhi un hazraat ke khilaf hoti usey mehfooz rakhtey aur joon hi raat ka andhera chhaa jata ghaare-saur mein un hazraat ke paas pahunch kar tamam tafseelaat ki itlaa detey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke Maula Aamir-bin-Fuhaira (Raziallahu anhu) doodh dene wali bakriyan charaatey they aur jab raat ka aik hissey guzar jata to un bakriyon ko ghaare-saur ki taraf haank latey they. aap hazraat bakriyon ke doodh par raat guzaartey aur subah ki po phat'tey hi Aamir-bin-Fuhaira (Raziallahu anhu) wahan se rawaana ho jatey. un teen raaton mein unhon-ne har raat aisa hi kya."
"5808","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fateh Makka ke saal (Makka Mukarrama mein) dakhil huey to aap ke sar par khaud thi."
"5809","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jism par (Yaman ke) Najran ki bani hui motey haashiye ki aik chadar thi. itney mein aik dehati aa gaya aur us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chadar ko pakad kar itni zor se kheenchaa ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mundhey par dekha ke iske zor se kheenchney ki wjah se nishan pad gaya tha. phir usne kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey is maal mein se diye janey ka hukm kiijiye jo Allah ka maal aap ke paas hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf mutwajjeh huey aur muskuraaey aur aap ne usey diye janey ka hukm farmaayaa."
"5810","aik aurat aik chadar lekar aaein (jo us ne khud bunii thi) Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tumhen malum hai wo parda kya tha phir batlaya ke ye aik ooni chadar thi jiske kinaron par haashiya hota hai. un khatun ne hazir ho kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye chadar maine khas aap ke odhney ke liye bunii hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar unse is tarah li maano aapko uski zarurat hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey tahmad ke taur par pahan kar hamarey paas tashrif laey. sahaba ki jama'at mein se aik sahib ( Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ( ne us chadar ko chhuwa aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! ye mujhey inayat farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha . jitni der Allah ne chaha aap majlis mein baithey rahe phir tashrif le gaey aur us chadar ko lapet kar un sahib ke paas bhijwa diya. sahaba ne is par unse kaha tum ne achi baat nahi ki ki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wo chadar maang li. tumhen malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kabhi sawal karney waley ko mahroom nahi farmatey. un sahib ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! maine to sirf Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye isliye mangi hai ki jab main maroon to ye mera kafan ho. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya chunanche wo chadar us sahabi ke kafan hi mein istemal hui."
"5811","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein se jannat mein 70 hazaar ki aik jamat dakhil hogi unke chehrey chaand ki tarah chamak rahe hongey. Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) apni dhaarii daar chadar sanbhaaltey huey uthey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mere liye bhi dua kijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey unhiin mein se bana de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! Ukasha ko bhi unhiin mein se bana de. iske baad qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se bana de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum se pahley Ukasha dua kara chukaa."
"5812","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kis tarah ka kapda zyada pasand tha bayan kya ke Hibra ki sabz yamnii chadar ."
"5813","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tamam kapdon mein yamnii sabz chadar pahannaa chahiye bahut pasand thi."
"5814","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to aap ki laash Mubarak par aik sabz yamnii chadar daal di gaee thi."
"5816","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab aakhiri marz taarii hua to aap apni kamlii chehra Mubarak par daltey they aur jab saans ghutney lagta to chehra khol letey aur usi haalat mein farmatey ''yahood w nasara Allah Taala ki rehmat se door ho gaey ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liyaa.'' Nabi Karim (sl) unke burey kaamo se (musalmaanon ko) dara rahe they."
"5817","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni aik naqshii chadar mein Namaz padhi aur uske naqsh w nigaar par Namaz hi mein aik nazar dali . phir salam pher kar farmaya ke meri ye chadar abu-Jaheem ko wapas de do. us ne abhi mujhey meri Namaz se ghaafil kar diya tha aur abu-Jaheem ki saadii chadar letey aao . ye abu-Jaheem bin Huzefa bin ghaanim bani Adii-bin Kab qabeeley mein se they."
"5818","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hamein aik motii kamlii ( كساء (aur aik motii izaar nikal kar dikhai aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rooh un hi 2 kapdon mein qabz hui thi."
"5819","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaya aur do waqt namazon se bhi aap ne mana farmaya, namaze-Fajr ke baad suraj buland honey tak aur Asr ke baad suraj ghurub honey tak aur us se mana farmaya ke koi shakhs sirf aik kapda jism par lapet kar ghutney uper utha kar is tarah baith jaey ke uski sharmgah par aasman w zameen ke darmyan koi cheez na ho aur ishtimaale-Sammaa (chaadar ko is tarah lapetna ki jism ka ek taraf ka hissa khula rahe) se mana farmaayaa."
"5820","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do tarah ke pahnaawey aur do tarah ki khareed w farokht se mana farmaya, khareed w farokht mein mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaya, mulaamisa ki sura ye thi ke aik shakhs ( khareedaar ( doosrey ( bechney waale) ke kapdey ko raat ya din mein kisi bhi waqt bas chhu deta (aur dekhey baghair sirf chhooney se Sauda ho jaata) sirf chhoonaa hi kafi tha khol kar dekha nahi jata tha. munaabiza ki sura ye thi ke aik shakhs apni milkiyat ka kapda doosrey ki taraf phainktaa aur doosra apna kapda phainktaa aur baghair dekhey aur baghair aapsi raza mandi ke sirf usi se Sauda taey ho jata aur do kapdey (jin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya unhein mein se aik ( ishtimaale-Sammaa hai (chaadar ko is tarah lapetna ki jism ka ek taraf ka hissa khula rahe). صماء (Sammaa) ki sura ye thi ke apna kapda (eik chadar ( apne aik shaaney par is tarah daala jata ke aik kinara se (sharmgaah) khul jati aur koi doosra kapda wahan nahi hota tha. doosrey pahnaawey ka tariqa ye tha ke baith kar apne aik kapdey se kamar aur pindlii baandh letey they aur sharmgah par koi kapda nahi hota tha."
"5821","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do tarah ke pahnaawey se mana farmaya ye ke koi shakhs aik hi kapdey se apni kamar aur pindlii ko mila kar baandh ley aur sharmgah par koi doosra kapda na ho aur ye ke koi shakhs aik kapdey ko is tarah jism par lapetey ke aik taraf kapdey ka koi hissey na ho aur aap ne mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaayaa."
"5822","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishtimaale-Sammaa se mana farmaya aur us se bhi ke koi shakhs aik kapdey se pindlii aur kamar ko mila ley aur sharmgah par koi doosra kapda na ho."
"5823","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein kuchh kapdey laey gaey jis mein aik chhoti kali kamlii bhi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara kya khayal hai ye chadar kisey di jaaey? sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh rahe phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Umme- Khalid ko mere paas bula laao. unhein god mein utha kar laya gaya (kyonke bachchii thiin) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar apne hath mein li aur unhein pahnaayaa aur dua di ke jeetii raho. is chadar mein harey aur zard naqsh w nigaar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme- Khalid ! ye naqsh w nigaar ''sanaah'' hain. ''sanaah'' habshi zaban mein khub achchhey ke mana mein aata hai."
"5824","jab Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke Anas is bachchey ko dekhtey raho koi cheez iske pet mein na jaey aur ja kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne sath lao taake Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna joothaa iske munh mein daalein . chunanche main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt aik baagh mein they aur aap ke jism par qabila bani hurraiyas ki bani hui chaadar  (khameesa حريثية) thi aur aap us sawari par nishan laga rahe they jis par aap fateh Makka ke mauqe par Sawar they."
"5825","unhon-ne apni biwi ko talaaq de di thi. phir unse Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) ne nikah kar liya tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke wo khatun sabz odhnii odhey huey thin, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se (apne shauhar ki) shikayat ki aur apne jism par sabz nishanat (chot ke) dikhaaey phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to (jaisaa ke aadat hai) Ikrima ne bayan kya ke auratein aapas mein aik doosrey ki madad karti hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se) kaha ke kisi eman wali aurat ka maine us se zyada bura haal nahi dekha unka jism unke kapdey se bhi zyada bura ho gaya hai. bayan kya ke unke shauhar ne bhi sun liya tha ke (unkii) biwi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaee hai chunanche wo bhi aagey aur unke sath unke do bachchey unse pehlii biwi ke they. unki biwi ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey unse koi aur shikayat nahi albatta unke sath us se zyada aur kuchh nahi jis se mera kuchh nahi hota. unhon-ne apne kapdey ka pallu pakad kar ishara kya (yani unke shauhar kamzor hain) is par unke shauhar ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Allah ki qism ye jhoot boltii hai main to usko (hambistarii ke waqt) chamdey ki tarah udhairh (ادھیڑ) kar rakh deta hun magar ye shareer hai, ye mujhey pasand nahi karti aur Rifaa ke yahan dobara jana chahti hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke agar ye baat hai to tumharey liye wo (rifa'a) us waqt tak halal nahi hoga jab tak ye (Abdur-Rehmaan doosrey shauhar) tumhara mazaa na chakh lein. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur-Rehman ke sath do bachchey bhi dekhey to malum farmaya kya ye tumharey bachchey hain? unhon-ne arz kya ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : achchha , is wjah se tum ye baatein sochtii ho. Allah ki qism ye bachchey unse itney hi mushabeh (similar) hain jitna ke kowa koey se mushabeh (similar) hota hai."
"5826","jange-Uhud ke mauqe par maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain baain do aadmiyon ko (jo Farishtey they) dekha wo safaid kapdey pahney huey they maine unhein na us se pahley dekha aur na iske baad kabhi dekha."
"5827","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aap ke jism par safaid kapda tha aur aap so rahe they phir dobara hazir hua to aap bedaar ho chukey they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis bande ne bhi kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( ''Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahin'' ko maan liya aur phir usi par wo maraa to jannat mein jaeyga maine arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey us ne chori ki ho, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chahey us ne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho, maine phir arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho. farmaya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho. maine (hairat ki wjah se phir) arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho ya usne chori ki ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya chahey usne zina kya ho chahey usne chori ki ho. Abu-Zar ki naak khaak aalud ho. Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) baad mein jab bhi ye hadis bayan kartey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke alfaz Abu-Zar ke (على رغم) (وإن رغم أنف أبي ذر) zaroor bayan kartey. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ye sura ke (sirf kalima se jannat mein dakhil hoga) ye us waqt hogi jab maut ke waqt ya us se pahley (gunaahon se) tauba ki aur kaha ke) لا إله إلا الله ( uski maghfirat ho jaeygi."
"5828","hamarey paas umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka maktoob (khat) aaya ham us waqt Utba-bin- Farqad (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath aazar baaijaan mein they (is mein likha tha) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne resham ke istemal se (mardon ko) mana kya hai siwa itney ke aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne angoothey ke qareeb ki apni donon ungliyon ke ishaarey se uski miqdar batai . abu-Usman nehdi ne bayan kya ke hamari samajh main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad us se ( kapdey wghaira resham ke) phool botey banaaney se thi."
"5829","hamein umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne likha us waqt ham aazar baaijaan mein they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne resham pahnney se mana farmaya tha siwa itney ke aur uski wazaahat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do ungliyon ke ishaarey se ki thi. Zuhair (raawii hadis) ne beech ki aur shahadat ki ungliyan utha kar bataya ."
"5830","ham Utba (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein likha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''duniyaa mein resham jo shakhs bhi pahney ga usey aakhirat mein nahi pahnaayaa jaaeyga.''"
"5831","Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) madaain mein they. unhon-ne pani maanga . aik dehati chandi ke bartan mein pani laya. unhon-ne usey phenk diya aur kaha ke maine sirf usey isliye phainkaa hai ke main us shakhs ko mana kar chuka hun (ke chandi ke bartan mein mujhey khana aur pani na diya karo) lekin wo nahi maanaa . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke sonaa, chaandii, resham aur deebaa un (kuffaar) ke liye duniya mein hai aur tumharey (musalmaanon) ke liye aakhirat mein."
"5832","is par maine puchha kya ye riwayat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hai? Abdul-Azeez ne bayan kya ke hargiz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwaayat hui hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mard reshamii libaas duniya mein pahney ga wo aakhirat mein usey hargiz nahi pahan sakega."
"5833","Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke jis mard ne duniya mein resham pehna wo aakhirat mein usey nahi pahan sakega."
"5834","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis mard ne duniya mein resham pehna wo usey aakhirat mein nahi pahan sakega aur ham se abu-Ma'mar ne bayan kya, unse Abdul-Waris ne bayan kya, unse Yazeed ne ke Muaz ne bayan kya ke mujhey Umme- Amr binte- Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"5835","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se resham ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jao aur unse poochho . bayan ki ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke mujhey abu-Hafs yani umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke duniya mein resham to wahi mard pahney ga jiska aakhirat mein koi hissey na ho. maine is par kaha ke sach kaha aur abu-Hafs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf koi jhooti baat nisbat nahi kar saktey aur Abdullah-bin -Rijaa ne bayan kya ke ham se Jarir ne bayan kya, unse Yahya ne aur unse Imran ne aur poori hadis bayan ki."
"5836","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko resham ka aik kapda hadiya mein pesh hua to ham usey chhooney lagey aur uski (narmii w mulaaimiyat par) hairat zada ho gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhen is par hairat hai. ham ne arz kya ji haan farmaya, jannat mein Sad-bin-Muaz ke roomaal us se bhi achchhey hain."
"5837","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney aur chandi ke bartan mein peeney aur khaney se mana farmaya tha aur resham aur deebaaj pahnney aur is par baithney se mana farmaya tha."
"5838","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein surkh ( maisra (aur (qissii) ke pahnney se mana farmaya hai."
"5839","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber aur Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ko kyonke unhein khaarish ho gaee thi, resham pahnney ki ijazat di thi."
"5840","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey reshamii dhaariyon wala aik jodaa, hulla inayat farmaya, main usey pahan kar nikla to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehre par ghusse ke aasaar dekhey. chunanche maine iske tukdey karke apni azeez aurton mein baant diye."
"5841","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne reshamii dhaariyon wala aik joda farokht hotey dekha to arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! behtar hai ke aap usey khareed lein aur wufood se mulaqat ke waqt aur Juma ke din usey pahan liya karein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey wo pehnta hai jiska (aakhirat mein) koi hissey nahi hota. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas resham ki dhaariyon wala aik joda hulla bhejaa, hadiye ke taur par. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya aap ne mujhey ye joda hulla inayat farmaya hai halanke main khud aap se iske barey mein wo baat sun chuka hun jo aap ne farmai thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhen ye kapda isliye diya hai ke usey bech do ya (aurton wghaira mein se) kisi ko pehna do."
"5842","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Umme-Kulsum (Raziallahu anhu) ko zard dhaarii daar reshamii joda pahney dekha."
"5843","main umr (Raziallahu anhu) se un aurton ke barey mein jinhoney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke maamle mein ittifaq kar liya tha, poochhney ka irada karta raha lekin unka raub samney aa jata tha. aik din (Makka ke raaste mein) aik manzil par qiyam kya aur peelu ke darakhton main (wo qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye) tashrif ley gaey. jab qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) se farigh ho kar wapas tashrif laey to maine puchha unhon-ne batlaya ke Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) hain phir kaha ke jahiliyat mein ham aurton ko koi haisiyat nahi detey they. jab Islam aaya aur Allah Taala ne unka zikr kya (aur unke huqooq) mardon par bataaey tab ham ne jana ke unke bhi ham par kuchh huquq hain lekin ab bhi ham apne maamlaat mein unka dakheel bannaa pasand nahi kartey they. mere aur meri biwi mein kuchh guftgu ho gaee aur us ne tez w tund jawab mujhey diya to maine us se kaha achchha ab naubat yahan tak pahunch gaee. usne kaha tum mujhey ye kehtey ho aur tumhari beti Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bhi takleef pahunchaatii hai. main (apni beti ummul-momeneen) Hafsa ke paas aaya aur us se kaha, main tujhey tanbeeh karta hun ke Allah aur uske rasool ki nafarmani kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko takleef pahunchaney ke maamle mein sabse pahley mein hi Hafsa ke yahan gaya phir main Umme-Salma ke paas aaya aur unse bhi yahi baat kahi lekin unhon-ne kaha ke hairat hai tum par Umar! tum hamarey maamlaat mein dakheel ho gaey ho. sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ki beeviyon ke maamlaat mein dakhal dena baqi tha. (so ab wo bhi shuru kar diyaa) unhon-ne meri baat radd kar di. qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi they jab wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein maujood na hotey aur main hazir hota to tamam khabrein unse aa kar bayan karta tha aur jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat se ghair hazir hota aur wo maujood hotey to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mutaalliq tamam khabrein mujhey aa kar sunatey they. aap ke charon taraf jitney ( badshah wghaira) they un sabse aap ke ta'lluqaat theek they. sirf Sham (Syria) ke mulk ghassaan ka hamein khof rehta tha ke wo kahin ham par hamla na kar de. maine jo hosh w hawaas durust kiye to wahi Ansari sahabi they aur keh rahe they ke aik haadisa ho gaya. maine kaha kya baat hui. kya ghassaan chadh aaya hai. unhon-ne kaha ke us se bhi bada haadisa ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di. mein jab (Madeena) hazir hua to tamam beeviyon ke hujron se roney ki awaz aa rahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaana par chaley gaey they aur bula khaane ke darwaze par aik naujawaan pahrey daar maujood tha maine uske paas pahunch kar us se kaha ke mere liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se andar hazir honey ki ijazat maang lo phir main andar gaya to aap aik chatai par tashrif rakhtey they jiske nishanat aap ke pahlu par padey huey they aur aap ke sar ke nichey aik chhota sa chamdey ka takiya tha. jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi. chand kachchi khaalein latak rahi thin aur babool ke patey they. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni un baton ka zikr kya jo maine Hafsa aur Umme-Salma se kahi thin aur wo bhi jo Umme-Salma ne meri baat radd kartey huey kaha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par muskuraa diye. aap ne us bula khaana mein untees din tak qiyam kya phir aap wahan se nichey utar aaey."
"5844","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ke waqt bedaar huey aur kaha Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi, kaisii-kaisii balaaein us raat mein nazil ho rahi hain aur kya-kyaa rahmatein uske khazaanon se utar rahi hain. koi hai jo un hujre waaliyon ko bedaar kar de. dekho bahut si duniya mein pahnney odhney waaliyaan aakhirat mein nangii hongii. Zohri ne bayan kya ke hinda apni aastinon mein ungliyon ke darmyan ghundiyaan lagaatii thin, taake sirf ungliyan khulein us se aagey na khuley."
"5845","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh kapdey aaey jin mein aik kali chadar bhi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara kya khayal hai, kisey ye chadar di jaaey? sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh rahe phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme- Khalid ko bula laao. chunanche mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya aur mujhey wo chadar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se inayat farmai aur farmaya der tak jeetii raho, 2 martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir aap us chadar ke naqsh-w-nigaar ko dekhney lagey aur apne hath se meri taraf ishara karke farmaya umme-Khalid! (سنا ‏,والسنا) ye habshi zaban ka lafz hai yani waah kya zeb deti hai. Is'haaq-bin-Saeed ne bayan kya ke mujh se mere ghar ki aik aurat ne bayan kya kaha ke unhon-ne wo chadar Umme- Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas dekhi thi."
"5846","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya ke koi mard zafran ke rang ka istemal kare."
"5847","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya tha ke koi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) waras ya zafran se ranga hua kapda pahney."
"5848","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) miyaanaa qad they aur maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko surkh jodey mein dekha aap se zyada khoobsurat koi cheez maine nahi dekhi."
"5849","hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) chizon ka hukm diya tha. bimar ki iyaadat ka, janaaze ke peechhey chalney ka, chheenkney waley ka jawab (yarhamakallaah se) dene ka aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham, deebaa, qissii, istibraq aur surkh zeen poshon ke istemal se bhi mana farmaya tha."
"5850","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jootey pahney huey Namaz padhtey they? to unhon-ne kaha ke haan."
"5851","main aapko char aisi cheezein kartey dekhta hun jo maine aap ke kisi sathi ko kartey nahi dekha. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ibne-Juraij! wo kya cheezein hain? unhon-ne kaha ke maine aapko dekha hai ke aap (khaana Kaba ke) kisi koney ko tawaaf mein hath nahi lagaatey sirf 2 arkaan Yamani (yani sirf rukn Yamani aur hajre-Aswad) ko chhotey hain aur maine aapko dekha hai ke aap saaf zeen ke chamdey ka jootaa pahntey hain aur maine aapko dekha ke aap apna kapda zard rang se rangtey hain ya zard khizaab lagaatey hain aur maine aapko dekha ke jab Makka mein hotey hain to sab log to Zil-Hijja ka chaand dekh kar ehram baandh letey hain lekin aap ehram nahi baandhtey balke tarwiya ke din (8 Zil-Hijja ko) ko ehram baandhtey hain. unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke khaana Kaba ke arkaan ke mutaalliq jo tum ne kaha to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hamesha sirf hajre-Aswad aur rukne-Yamaanii ko chhootey dekha. saaf tarii ke chamdey ke jooton ke mutaalliq jo tum ne puchha to maine dekha hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi chamdey ka jootaa pahntey they jis mein baal nahi hotey they aur aap usko pahney huey wuzu kartey they isliye main bhi pasand karta hun ke aisa hi jootaa istemal karun. zard rang ke mutaalliq tum ne jo kaha hai to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us se khizaab kartey ya kapdey rangtey dekha hai is liye main bhi us zard rang ko pasand karta hun aur raha ehram baandhney ka masla to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap usi waqt ehram baandhtey jab oont par Sawar ho kar janey lagtey."
"5852","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ko zafran ya waras se ranga hua kapda pahnney se mana farmaya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisey jootey na milein wo mozey hi pahan lein lekin unko takhney ke nichey tak kaat dein."
"5853","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jiske paas ehram baandhney ke liye tehband na ho wo paa-jaama pahan ley (iska kaatna zaroori nahi hai) aur jiske paas jootey na hon wo mozey hi pahan ley lekin takhnon ke nichey tak unko kaat daley (jaisaa ke pichhli hadis mein hai)."
"5854","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tahaarat mein kangha karne main aur jootaa pahnney mein dahini taraf se shuru karne ko pasand farmatey they."
"5855","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs jootaa pahney to daain taraf se shuru karey aur jab utaarey to baain taraf se utaarey taake dahini taraf pahnney mein awwal ho aur utaarney mein aakhir ho."
"5856","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein koi shakhs sirf aik paon mein jootaa pahan kar na chaley ya donon paon nangaa rakhey ya donon mein jootaa pahney."
"5857","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chappal mein 2 tasmey they."
"5858","Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) 2 jootey lekar hamarey paas bahar aaey jis mein 2 tasmey lagey huey they. Sabit Bunani ne kaha ke ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jootey hain."
"5859","mein (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) khidmate-nabawii mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chamdey ke aik surkh kheme mein tashrif rakhey huey they aur maine Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ka pani liye huey hain aur sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ke pani ko ley leney mein aik doosrey ke aagey badhney ki koshish kar rahe hain. agar kisi ko kuchh pani mil jata hai to wo usey apne badan par laga leta hai aur jisey kuchh nahi milta wo apne sathi ke hath ki tarii hi ko lagaaney ki koshish karta hai."
"5860","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ko bulwaya aur unhein laal chamdey ke aik kheme mein jama kya."
"5861","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein chatai ka gheraa bana letey they aur us gherey mein Namaz padhtey they aur usi chatai ko din mein bichhaatey they aur is par baithtey they phir log (raat ki Namaz ke waqt) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jama honey lagey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ki iqtida (pairvi) karne lagey jab majma' zyada badh gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke logo! amal itney hi kya karo jitni ke tum mein taqat ho kyonke Allah Taala (ajr dene se) nahi thaktaa magar tum (amal se) thak jatey ho aur Allah ki bargah mein sabse zyada pasand wo amal hai jisey pabandi se hamesha kya jaey, chahe wo kam hi ho."
"5862","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qubaaein (chaadarein) aai hain aur aap unhein taqseem farma rahe hain. hamein bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley chalo. chunanche ham gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ghar hi mein paya. walid ne mujh se kaha betey mera naam lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaao. maine usey bahut badi tauheen aamez baat samjha (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne walid ke liye bula kar takleef doon) chunanche maine walid sahib se kaha ke main aap ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaaun ! unhon-ne kaha ke betey haan. aap koi Jaabir sifat insan nahi hain. chunanche maine bulaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif ley aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uper deebaa ki aik Quba thi jis mein soney ki ghundiyaan lagi hui thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Makhrima usey maine tumharey liye chipa ke rakha hua tha. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar unhein inayat farma di."
"5863","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) chizon se rokaa tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney ki anguthi se ya rawi ne kaha ke soney ke chhalley se, resham se, istibraq se, deebaa se, surkh maisara se, qissii se aur chandi ke bartan se mana farmaya tha aur hamein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) chizon yani bimar ki mizaaj pursi karne , janaaze ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ka jawab dene, salam ke jawab dene, dawat karne waley ki dawat qabool karne, (kisi baat par) qism kha leney waley qism poori karaaney aur mazloom ki madad karne ka hukm farmaya tha."
"5864","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki anguthi ke pahnney se mardon ko mana farmaya tha aur Amr ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Shoba ne khabar di, unhein Qatada ne, unhon-ne nazar se suna aur unhon-ne Bashir se suna, aagey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"5865","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai aur uska nageena hatheli ki taraf rakha phir kuchh doosrey logon ne bhi isi tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa lein. aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey phenk diya aur chandi ki anguthi banwaa li."
"5866","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ya chandi ki anguthi banwaai aur uska nageena hatheli ki taraf rakha aur is par (Muhammad rasoolullah.) ke alfaz khudwaaey phir doosrey logon ne bhi isi tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa liin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke kuchh doosrey logon ne bhi is tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa li to aap ne usey phenk diya aur farmaya ke ab main usey kabhi nahi pahnoonga. phir aap ne chandi ki anguthi banwaai aur doosrey logon ne bhi chandi ki anguthiyan banwaa liin. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad us anguthi ko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne pehna phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) aur phir Usman ne pehna . aakhir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke daure-khilaafat mein wo anguthi arees ke kuwein mein gir gaee."
"5867","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hurmat se pahley) soney ki anguthi pahntey they phir hurmat ka hukm aaney par aap ne usey phenk diya aur farmaya ke main ab se kabhi nahi pahnoonga aur logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan phenk din."
"5868","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik din chandi ki anguthi dekhi phir doosrey logon ne bhi chandi ki anguthiyan banwaanii shuru kar diin aur pahnney lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni anguthi phenk di aur doosrey logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan phenk din. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ibrahim bin Sad , Ziyad aur Shuaib ne Zohri se ki hai aur ibne- musaafir ne Zohri se bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke) khaatmaa waraq sey) bayan kya."
"5869","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne anguthi banwaai thi? unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat isha ki Namaz aadhi raat mein padhai. phir chehra Mubarak hamari taraf kya, jaisey ab bhi main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi ki chamak dekh raha hun. farmaya ke bahut se log Namaz padh kar so chukey hongey lekin tum is waqt bhi Namaz mein ho jab tak tum Namaz ka intizar kartey rahe ho."
"5870","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi chandi ki thi aur iska nageena bhi usi ka tha aur Yahya bin Ayub ne bayan kya ke mujh se humaid ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah bayan kya."
"5871","aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha ke main apne aapko hiba karne aai hon, der tak wo aurat khadi rahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha aur phir sar jhukaa liya jab der tak wo wahin khadi rahen to aik sahib ne uth kar arz kya : agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unki zarurat nahi hai to unka nikah mujh se kar dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumharey paas koi cheez hai jo mehar mein unhein de sako, unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dekh lo. wo gaey aur wapas aa kar arz kya ke Allah ki qism ! mujhey kuchh nahi mila. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao talash karo, lohey ki aik anguthi hi sahii . wo gaey aur wapas aa kar arz kya ke wo mujhey lohey ki aik anguthi bhi nahi milii. wo aik tahmad pahney huey they aur unke jism par (kurtey ki jagah) chadar bhi nahi thi. unhon-ne arz kya ke main unhein apna tahmad mehar mein de doonga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhara tahmad ye pahan lengii to tumharey liye kuchh baqi nahi rahega aur agar tum usey pahan logey to unke liye kuchh nahi rahega. wo sahib iske baad aik taraf baith gaey phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein jatey dekha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulwaya aur farmaya tumhen Quran kitna yad hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke falan-falan soortein. unhon-ne Suraton ko shumaar kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ja maine us aurat ko tumharey nikah mein us Quran ke iwaz mein de diya jo tumhen yad hai."
"5872","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ajam ke kuchh logon (shaahaane-ajam) ke paas khat likhnaa chaha to aap se kaha gaya ke ajam ke log koi khat us waqt tak nahi qabool kartey jab tak is par mehar lagi hui na ho. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwai. jis par ye khuda tha (Muhammad rasool Allah). maano us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungli ya aap ki hatheli mein uski chamak dekh raha hun."
"5873","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwai. wo anguthi aap ke hath mein, iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein, iske baad Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rehti thi lekin unke zamane mein wo arees ke kuwein mein gir gaee iska naqsh (Muhammad rasoolullah) tha."
"5874","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik anguthi banwaai aur farmaya ke ham ne aik anguthi banwaai hai is par lafz (Muhammad rasoolullah) kanda karaya hai isliye anguthi par koi shakhs ye naqsh na khudwaaey. Anas ne bayan kya ke jaisey us anguthi ki chamak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chhanguliyaan mein ab bhi mein dekh raha hun."
"5875","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Rome (mojooda Itly) (ke badshah ko) khat likhaanaa chaha to aap se kaha gaya ke agar aap ke khat par mehar na hui to wo khat nahi padhtey. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai is par lafz (Muhammad rasool Allah) khudwaayaa. jaisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein uski safedi ab bhi mein dekh raha hun."
"5876","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pahley aik soney ki anguthi banwaai aur pahnney mein aap iska rang andar ki taraf rakhtey they. aap ki dekha dekhi logon ne bhi soney ki anguthiyan bana lin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par tashrif laey aur Allah ki hamd w sana ki aur farmaya maine bhi soney ki anguthi banwaai thi. (hurmat nazil honey ke baad) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab main usey nahi pahnoonga. phir aap ne wo anguthi phenk di aur logon ne bhi apni soney ki angoothiyon ko phenk diya. Juweriya ne bayan kya ke mujhey yahi yad hai ke Naafe ne ''daahiney hath mein'' bayan kya."
"5877","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai aur is mein ye naqsh khudwaayaa (Muhammad rasoolullah) aur logon se keh diya ke maine chandi ki aik anguthi banwaa kar is par (Muhammad Rasulullah ( naqsh karwaya hai. isliye ab koi shakhs ye naqsh apni anguthi par na khudwaaey."
"5878","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jab khaleefa huey to unhon-ne mujh ko zakat ke masayel likhwaa diye aur anguthi (mohar) ka naqsh teen linon mein tha aik line mein ''Muhammad'' dusri line mein ''rasool'' aur teesri line mein ''Allaah''."
"5879","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi wafat tak aap ke hath mein rahi. aap ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath main aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rahi phir jab Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ka zamana aaya to wo arees ke kuwein par aik martaba baithey, bayan kya ke phir anguthi nikaalii aur usey ulatney-palatney lagey ke itney mein wo (kuwein mein) gir gaee. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ham teen din tak usey dhoondtey rahe aur kuwein ka Sara pani bhi kheench daala lekin wo anguthi nahi mili ."
"5880","mein eidul-fitr ki Namaz main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutbe se pahley Namaz padhai aur ibne-wahab ne Juraij se ye lafz badhaatey ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton ke majma' ki taraf gaey (aur sadqe ki targheeb dilaaii) to auratein Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey mein chhalley daar anguthiyan dalney lagein."
"5881","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-fitr ke din (aabaadii se baahar) gaey aur 2 rakaat Namaz padhai aap ne us se pahley aur uske baad koi dusri nafl Namaz nahi padhi phir aap aurton ke majme' ki taraf aaey aur unhein sadqe ka hukm farmaya, chunanche auratein apni baaliyaan aur khushbu aur mushk ke haar sadqe mein dene lagiin."
"5882","Asma (Raziallahu anha) ka haar (jo Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne udhaar liya tha) gum ho gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey talash karne ke liye chand sahaba ko bheja usi doran mein Namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur log bila wuzu ( wuzu ke baghair ( they chunkey pani bhi maujood nahi tha, isliye sab ne bila wuzu Namaz padhi phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya to tayammum ki aayat nazil hui. ibne-Numair ne ye izafa kya, unse Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ke wo haar unhon-ne Asma se udhaar liya tha."
"5883","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eid ke din 2 rakatein padhaaiin na iske pahley koi Namaz padhi aur na iske baad phir aap aurton ki taraf tashrif laaey, aap ke sath Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) they. aap ne aurton ko sadqe ka hukm farmaya to wo apni baaliyaan Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ki jholii mein dalney lagiin."
"5884","main Madina ke bazaron mein se aik bazar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas huey to main phir aap ke sath wapas hua, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya bachcha kahan hai. ye aap ne teen martaba farmaya, Hasan-bin-Ali ko bulaao. Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aa rahe they aur unki gardan main ( khushbu daar long wghaira ka ( haar padaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath is tarah phailaayaa ke (aap Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ko galley se lagaaney ke liye) aur Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi apna hath phailaayaa aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se lipat gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey Allaah! mein us se mohabbat karta hun to bhi us se mohabbat kar aur unse bhi mohabbat kar jo us se mohabbat rakhein. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ke baad koi shakhs bhi Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se zyada mujhey pyara nahi tha."
"5885","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un mardon par laanat bheji jo aurton jaisa chaal chalan ikhtiyar karein aur un aurton par laanat bheji jo mardon jaisa chaal chalan ikhtiyar karein. ghandar ke sath is hadis ko Amr bin marzooq ne bhi Shoba se riwayat kya."
"5886","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukhannas mardon par aur mardon ki chaal-chalan ikhtiyar karne wali aurton par laanat bheji aur farmaya ke un zanaana banney waley mardon ko apne gharon se bahar nikal do. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne falan heejdey ko nikala tha aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne falan heejdey ko nikala tha."
"5887","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas tashrif rakhtey they. ghar mein aik mukhannas bhi tha, us ne Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke bhai Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha Abdullaah! agar kal tumhen Taaif par fateh hasil ho jaey to main tumhen binte- Ghelaan ( baadiya naam ke) ko dikhlaaoonga wo jab samney aati hai to (iske motaapey ki wjah se) char silwatein dikhai deti hain aur jab peeth pherti hai to aath (8) silwatein dikhai deti hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab ye shakhs tum logon ke paas na aaya kare. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (rh)) ne kaha ke samney se char silwaton ka matlab ye hai ke (motey honey ki wjah se) iske pet mein char silwatein padi hui hain aur jab wo samney aati hai to wo dikhai deti hain aur aath (8) silwaton se peechhey phirtii hai ka mafhoom hai) aagey ki) un charon silwaton ke kinarey kyonke ye donon pahluon ko gherey huey hotey hain aur phir wo mil jati hain aur hadis main ( بثمان‏ (ka lafz hai halanke qaayede ke mutabiq nahw ke) بثمانية‏ . Mina ( hona tha kyonke murad aath (8) aas-paas yani kinarey hain aur) لأطراف ( , Mina ( taraf ( ki jama hai aur) taraf (ka lafz muzakkar hai. magar chunkey ( لأطراف (ka lafz mazkoor na tha isliye ( بثمان‏ ( bhi kehna durust hua."
"5888","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' moonchh ke baal katarwaanaa paidaaishii sunnat hai.''"
"5889","panch cheezein (farmaayaa ke) panch cheezein, khatna karaanaa, naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, baghl ke baal nochna, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur moonchh kam karaanaa paidaaishii sunnaton mein se hain."
"5890","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur moonchh katrana paidaaishii sunnatein hain.''"
"5891","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''paanch cheezein khatna karaanaa, naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, moonchh katraanaa, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur baghl ke baal nochna paidaaishii sunnatein hain.''"
"5892","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mushrekeen ke khilaf karo, dadhi chhod do aur munchhein katarwaao. '' Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) jab Haj ya Umra kartey to apni dadhi (haath se) pakad letey aur (muththii) se jo baal zyada hotey unhein katarwaa detey."
"5893","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''moonchhein khub katarwaayaa liya karo aur dadhi ko badhaao.''"
"5894","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khizaab istemal kya tha? boley ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal hi bahut kam safaid huey they."
"5895","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khizaab ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya to ahwal ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khizaab ki naubat hi nahi aai thi agar main aap ki dadhi ke safaid baal ginnaa chahta to gin sakta tha."
"5896","mere ghar walon ne Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke paas pani ka aik piyala lekar bheja (raawii hadis) Israel rawi ne teen ungliyan band kar lein yani wo itni chhoti piyaalii thi us piyaalii mein baalon ka aik guchchaa tha jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baalon mein se kuchh baal they. Usman ne kaha jab kisi shakhs ko nazar lag jati ya aur koi bimari hoti to wo apna pani ka bartan bii-bii Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke paas bhej detaa. (wo usmein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal dubo detein) Usman ne kaha ke maine naklkii ko dekha (jis mein muey Mubarak rakhey huey they) to surkh surkh baal dikhai diye."
"5897","mein Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon-ne hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand baal nikal kar dikhaaey jin par khizaab laga hua tha."
"5898","Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka baal dikhaya jo surkh tha."
"5899","yahood w nasara khizaab nahi lagaatey tum unke khilaf karo yani khizaab lagaya karo."
"5900","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut lambey nahi they aur na aap chhotey qad ke hi they (balke aap ka beech wala qad tha) na aap bilkul safaid bhoorey they aur na gehunwey rang ke hi they, aap ke baal ghunghraaley uljhey huey nahi they aur na bilkul seedhey latkey huey they. Allah Taala ne aapko chalis (40) saal ki umr mein rasool banaya das saal aap ne (nubuwat ke baad) Makka Mukarrama mein qiyam kya aur das saal Madina Munawra main aur taqriban sath saal ki umr mein Allah Taala ne aapko wafat di. wafat ke waqt aap ke sar aur dadhi mein bees baal bhi safaid nahi they."
"5901","maine surkh hulle mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada kisi ko khoobsurat nahi dekha (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke) mujh se mere kuchh ashaab ne Imam Malik (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar ke baal shaane Mubarak ke qareeb tak they. Abu-Ishaq ne bayan kya ke maine Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ko aik martaba se zyada ye hadis bayan kartey suna jab bhi wo ye hadis bayan kartey to muskuraatey. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Shoba ne ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal aap ke kanon ki lo tak they."
"5902","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya raat Kaba ke paas mujhey dikhaya gaya, maine dekha ke aik sahib hain gehunwey rang, gehunwey rang ke logon mein sabse zyada khoobsoorat, unke shaanon tak lambey lambey baal hain aisey baal waley logon mein sabse zyada khoobsoorat, unhon-ne baalon mein kangha kar rakha hai aur uski wjah se sar se pani tapak raha hai. 2 aadmiyon ka sahara liye huey hain ya 2 aadmiyon ke kandhon ka sahara liye huey hain aur khaana Kaba ka tawaaf kar rahe hain, maine puchha ke ye kon buzurg hain to mujhey bataya gaya ke ye Esa-ibne-Maryam (Alaihissalam) hain phir achcha maine aik uljhey huey ghunghraaley baal waley shakhs ko dekha, daain aankh se kaana tha maano angoor hai jo ubhraa hua hai. maine puchha ye kaana kon hai? mujhey bataya gaya ke ye Masih dajjal hai."
"5903","Nabi Karim ke baal moondhon tak pahunchtey they."
"5904","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke) sar ke) baal moondhon tak pahunchtey they."
"5905","maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baalon ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke aap ke baal darmyaana they, na bilkul seedhey latkey huey aur na ghunghraaley aur wo kanon aur moondhon ke beech tak they."
"5906","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath bharey huey they maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad aap jaisa (khoobsoorat koi aadmii) nahi dekha aap ke sar ke baal miyaanaa they na ghunghraaley aur na bilkul seedhey latkey huey."
"5907","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath aur paon bharey huey they. chehra Husain w jameel tha, maine aap jaisa khoobsurat koi na pahley dekha aur na baad mein, aap ki hatheliyan kushaada thin."
"5909","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bharey huey qadmon waley they, bahut hi Husain w jameel, aap jaisa khoobsurat maine aap ke baad kisi ko nahi dekha."
"5910","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadam aur hatheliyan bhari hui aur gudaaz thin."
"5912","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyan aur qadam bharey huey they, aap jaisa phir maine koi khoobsurat aadmi nahi dekha."
"5913","ham Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas baithey huey they. logon ne dajjal ka zikr kya aur kisi ne kaha ke uski donon aankhon ke darmyan lafz ''kaafir'' likha hoga. is par Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey maine to nahi suna albatta Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha ke agar tumhen Ibrahim ko dekhnaa ho to apne sahib (khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ko dekho (ke aap bilkul unke ham shakl hain) aur Musa (Alaihissalam) gehunwey rang ke hain baal ghunghraaley jaisey us waqt bhi main unhein dekh raha hun ke wo us naley waadiie-azraq naam ke main labbaik kehtey huey utar rahe hain unke surkh oont ki nakel ki rassii khajoor ki chhaal ki hai."
"5914","maine umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha ke jo shakhs sar ke baalon ko gondh ley (wo Haj ya Umerey se farigh ho kar sar mundaaey) aur jaisey ehram mein baalon ko jama letey hain ghair ehram mein na jamaaw aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey they maine to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko baal jamaatey dekha."
"5915","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne baal jama liye they aur ehram ke waqt yun aap labbaik keh rahe they لبيك اللهم لبيك ، Mina لبيك لا شريك لك لبيك ، Mina إن الحمد والنعمة لك والملك لا شريك لك in kalimaat ke uper aur kuchh aap nahi badhaatey they."
"5916","maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya baat hai ke log Umra karke ehram khol chukey hain halanke aap ne ehram nahi kholaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyonke maine apne sar ke baal jama liye hain aur apni qurbani ka janwar (qurbaanii ke jaanwar) ke galey mein haar daal diya hai. isliye jab tak meri qurbani ka nehar na ho ley main ehram nahi khol sakta."
"5917","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko agar kisi mas'ale mein koi hukm malum na hota to aap usmein ahle-kitab ke amal ko apnaatey they. ahle-kitab apne sar ke baal latkaey rakhtey aur mushrekeen maang nikaaltey they. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi (ahale-kitaab ki muwafiqat mein) pahley sar ke baal peshani ki taraf latkaatey lekin baad mein aap beech mein se maang nikalney lagey."
"5918","jaisey mein ab bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maang mein ehram ki haalat mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun. Abdullaah-bin-Rijaa ne (apni riwayat mein) مفرق النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم (waahid ke seegha (singular) ke saath) bayan kya yani maangon ki jagah sirf lafz maang istemal kya."
"5919","maine aik raat apni khala Ummul-Momenin Memuna binte- Haris (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar guzaarii, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye us raat unhiin ke yahan baari thi. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ki Namaz padhney khadey huey to main bhi aap ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey sar ke baalon ki aik lat pakdi aur mujhey apni dahini taraf kar diya."
"5920","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai aap ne ( قزع‏ . Mina ( se mana farmaya, Ubaidullah kehtey hain ke maine Naafe se puchha ke) قزع‏ . Mina ( kya hai? phir Ubaidullah ne hamein ishara se bataya ke Naafe ne kaha ke bachche ka sar mundaatey waqt kuchh yahan chhod de aur kuchh baal wahan chhod de. (to usey ( قزع‏ . Mina ( kehtey hain) usey Ubaidullah ne peshani aur sar ke donon kinaron ki taraf ishara karke hamein uski sura bataaii. Ubaidullah ne uski tafseer yun bayan ki, yani peshani par kuchh baal chhod diye jayen aur sar ke donon konon par kuchh baal chhod diye jaaein. phir Ubaidullah se puchha gaya ke usmein ladka aur ladki donon ka aik hi hukm hai? farmaya ke mujhey malum nahi. Naafe ne sirf ladkey ka lafz kaha tha. Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke maine Amr bin Naafe se dobara uske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ladkey ki kanpatii ya gaddii par choti ke baal agar chhod diye jayen to koi harj nahi hai lekin) قزع‏ . Mina ( ye hai ke peshani par baal chhod diye jayen aur baqi sab mundwaaey jayen isi tarah sar ke us taraf main aur is taraf mein."
"5921","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( قزع‏ . Mina ( se mana farmaya tha."
"5922","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ehram mein rehney ke liye apne hath se khushbu lagai maine isi tarah ( dasween taareekh ko) Mina mein tawaafe-ziyaarat karne se pahley apne hath se aapko khushbu lagaaii."
"5923","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sabse umda khushbu lagaya karti thi, yahan tak ke khushbu ki chamak mein aap ke sar aur aap ki dadhi mein dekhti thi."
"5924","aik sahib ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke diwar ke aik suraakh se ghar ke andar dekha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt apna sar kanghey se khujlaa rahe they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar mujhey malum hota ke tum jhank rahe ho to main tumhari aankh phod deta arey izn (ijaazat) lena to uske liye hai ke aadmi ki nazar (kisi ke) 70 par na padey."
"5925","mein haalat haiz ke bawajud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar mein kangha karti thi. ham se Abdullah-bin Yusuf ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Imam Malik ne khabar di, unhein Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne isi tarah ye hadis bayan ki."
"5926","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har kaam mein jahan tak mumkin hota dahini taraf se shuru karne ko pasand farmatey they, kangha karne aur wuzu karne mein bhii."
"5927","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(ke Allah Taala ne farmaya) ibne-Aadam ka har amal uska hai siwa roze ke ke ye mera hai aur main khud iska badla doonga aur roze-daar ke munh ke khushbu Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se bhi badh kar hai.''"
"5928","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ehram ke waqt umda se umda khushbu jo mil sakti thi, wo lagaatii."
"5929","(jab unko) khushbu (hadiya ki jati to) aap wo wapas nahi kya kartey they aur kehtey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi khushbu ko wapas nahi farmaya kartey they."
"5930","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par ehram kholney aur ehram baandhney ke waqt apne hath se zareera (eik qism ki murakkab) khushbu lagai thi."
"5931","Allah Taala ne Hasan ke liye godney waaliyon, gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur daanton ke darmyan kushadgi paida karne waaliyon par, jo Allah ki khilqat ko badlein un sab par laanat bheji hai, main bhi kyon na un logon par laanat karun jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat ki hai aur uski daleel ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laanat khud Quran Majeed mein maujood hai. aayat ( وما آتاكم الرسول فخذوه‏ ( hai."
"5932","Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se Haj ke saal mein suna wo Madina Munawra mein member par ye farma rahe they unhon-ne baalon ki aik choti jo unke chaukeedaar ke hath mein thi lekar kaha kahan hain tumharey ulma maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai aap is tarah baal banaaney se mana farma rahe they aur farma rahe they ke Bani-Israeel us waqt tabah ho gaey jab unki aurton ne is tarah apne baal sanwaarney shuru kar diye."
"5933","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' sar ke qudrati baalon mein masnooii baal lagaaney waaliyon par aur lagwaaney waaliyon par aur godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par Allah ne laanat bheji hai.''"
"5934","Ansar ki aik ladki ne shadi ki. iske baad wo bimar ho gaee aur uske sar ke baal jhad gaey, uske ghar walon ne chaha ke iske baalon mein masnooii baal laga dein. isliye unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali donon par laanat bheji hai. Shoba ke sath is hadis ko Muhammad-bin Ishaq ne bhi Aban bin Saleh se, unhon-ne hasan-bin-muslim se, unhon-ne Safiya se, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki hai."
"5935","aik khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha ke maine apni ladki ki shadi ki hai iske baad wo bimar ho gaee aur uske sar ke baal jhad gaey aur iska shauhar mujh par iske maamle mein zor deta hai. kya main iske sar mein masnooii baal laga dun? is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal jodney waaliyon aur judwaaney waaliyon ko bura kaha, un par laanat bheji ."
"5936","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur lagwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5937","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ne masnooii baal jodney waaliyon par, judwaaney waaliyon par, godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par laanat bheji hai.'' Naafe ne kaha ke godna kabhi masoodey par bhi goodaa jata hai."
"5938","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) aakhiri martaba Madina Munawra tashrif laey aur hamein khutba diya. aap ne baalon ka aik guchchaa nikal ke kaha ke ye yahudiyon ke siwa aur koi nahi karta tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ( zor . Mina ( yani faraibi farmaya yani jo baalon mein jod lagaey to aisa aadmi mard ho ya aurat wo makkaar hai jo apne makar w faraib par is taur par parda daalta hai."
"5939","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne khoobsoortii ke liye godney waaliyon, chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon aur samney ke daanton ke darmyan kushadgi paida karne waaliyon jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, un sab par laanat bheji to umme-ya'qoob ne kaha ke ye kya baat hui. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aakhir mein kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur kitabullah main is par laanat maujood hai. umme-ya'qoob ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! maine pura Quran Majeed padh daala aur kahin bhi aisi koi aayat mujhey nahi milii. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! agar tum ne padha hota to tumhen zaroor mil jata kya tum ko ye aayat malum nahi ( وما آتاكم الرسول فخذوه وما نهاكم عنه فانتهوا‏ ( yani ''aur jo kuchh rasool tumhen dein usey ley lo aur jis se bhi tumhen mana karein us se ruk jaao.''"
"5940","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali , godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5941","aik aurat ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke ya Rasulullah! meri ladki ko khasrey ka bukhar ho gaya aur us se iske baal jhad gaey. mein uski shadi bhi kar chuki hon to kya iske masnooii baal laga dun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur jiske lagaya jaey, donon par laanat bheji hai."
"5942","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, ya (raawii ne is tarah bayan kya ke) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''godney waali, gudwaaney waali, masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali '' yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un sab par laanat bheji hai."
"5943","Allah Taala ne godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur khoobsoortii paida karne ke liye samney ke daanton ke darmyan kushadgi karne waaliyon par jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, laanat bheji hai phir main kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur wo Allah ki kitab mein maujood hai."
"5944","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''nazar lag jana haq hai'' aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne godney se mana farmaayaa."
"5945","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khoon ki qeemat, kuttey ki qeemat khaney se mana farmaya aur sood leney waley aur dene waale, godney wali aur godaaney wali) par laanat bheji ( ."
"5946","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aik aurat laai gaee jo godney ka kaam karti thi. umr (Raziallahu anhu) khadey ho gaey (aur us waqt maujood sahaba se) kaha, main tumhen Allah ka waasta deta hun kisi ne kuchh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se godney ke mutaalliq suna hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine khadey ho kar arz kya : ameerul-momineen ! maine suna hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha kya suna hai? Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke godney ka kaam na karo aur na gudwaao."
"5947","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur lagwaaney wali aur godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5948","godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par, baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur khoobsoortii ke liye daanton ke darmyan kushadgi karne waaliyon par jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, Allah Taala ne laanat bheji hai phir main bhi kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur wo kitabullah mein bhi maujood hai."
"5949","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke rehmat ke Farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya moortein hon aur Lais-bin-Sad ne bayan kya, unse Yunus bin Yazeed ne, unse ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke mujh ko Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba ne khabar di, unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they ke maine abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, phir unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis naql ki hai."
"5950","ham Masruq bin ajda' ke sath Yasar bin Numer ke ghar mein they. Masruq ne unke ghar ke saaybaan mein tasweerein dekhiin to kaha ke maine Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ke paas qiyamat ke din tasweer banaaney walon ko sakht se sakht tar azab hoga.''"
"5951","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo log ye moortein banatey hain unhein qiyamat ke din azab kya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jisko tum ne banaya hai ab usmein jaan bhi daalo.''"
"5952","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne ghar mein jab bhi koi cheez aisi miltii jis par saleeb ki moorat bani ho ( jaisey nasara rakhtey hain) to usko tod daaltey."
"5953","mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Madina Munawra main ( Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke ghar mein) gaya to unhon-ne chhat par aik musawwir ko dekha jo tasweer bana raha tha, unhon-ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) Allah Taala irshad farmata hai) us shakhs se badh kar zaalim kon hoga jo meri makhlooq ki tarah paida karne chala hai agar usey yahi ghamand hai to usey chahiye ke aik daana paida karey, aik chewntii paida kare. phir unhon-ne pani ka aik tasht mangwaya aur apne hath usmein dhoey. jab baghl dhoney lagey to maine arz kya abu-Huraira! kya (baghl tak dhoney ke barey mein) tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kuchh suna hai unhon-ne kaha maine jahan tak zewar pehna ja sakta hai wahan tak dhoya hai."
"5954","maine apne walid (Qaasim-bin-abii-Bakar) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar (jange-Tabook) se tashrif laey to maine apne ghar ke saaybaan par aik parda latkaa diya tha, is par tasweerein thin jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha to usey kheench kar phenk diya aur farmaya ke qiyamat ke din sabse zyada sakht azab mein wo log giraftaar hongey jo Allah ki makhlooq ki tarah khud bhi banatey hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir maine phaad kar us parde ki aik ya 2 takiye bana liye."
"5955","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se aaey aur maine parda latkaa rakha tha jis mein tasweerein thin, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iske utaar leney ka hukm diya to maine usey utaar liya."
"5956","aur main aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik hi bartan mein ghusle-janabat kya kartey they."
"5957","unhon-ne aik gaddaa khareedaa jis par tasweerein thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (usey dekh kar) darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur andar tashrif nahi laey. maine arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! maine jo ghalati ki hai us se main Allah se maafi maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye gaddaa kis liye hai? maine arz kya ke aap ke baithney aur is par tek lagaaney ke liye hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un moorat ke banaaney walon ko qiyamat ke din azab diya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ne paida kya hai usey zinda bhi karke dikhao aur Farishtey us ghar mein nahi dakhil hotey jis mein moorat ho."
"5958","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''farishtey us ghar mein nahi dakhil hotey jis mein tasweerein hoon.'' Basar ne bayan kya ke (is hadis ko riwayat karne ke baad) phir Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) bimar padey to ham unki mizaaj pursi ke liye gaey. ham ne dekha ke unke darwaze par aik parda padaa hua hai jis par tasweer hai. maine Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke rabeeb (zere-parwarish) Ubaidullaah-bin-Aswad se kaha ke Zaid-bin-Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein us se pahley aik martaba tasweeron ke mutaalliq hadis sunai thi. Ubaidullah ne kaha ke kya tum ne suna nahi tha, hadis bayan kartey huey unhon-ne ye bhi kaha tha ke jo moorat kapdey mein ho wo jaaiz hai) basharte ke ghair zi Rooh ki ho) aur Abdullah-bin Wahab ne kaha, unhein Amr ne khabar di wo ibne-Haaris hain, unse Bukair ne bayan kya, unse Basar ne bayan kya, unse Zaid ne bayan kya, unse abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaya jaisa ke uper mazkoor hua."
"5959","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aik parda tha. usey unhon-ne ghar ke aik kinarey par latkaa diya tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye parda nikal daal, uski moorat us Namaz mein mere samney aati hain aur dil uchaat hota hai."
"5960","aik waqt par Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aaney ka wada kya lekin aaney mein der hui. us waqt par nahi aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sakht pareshan huey phir aap bahar nikley to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se mulaqat hui. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse shikayat ki to unhon-ne kaha ke ham ( Farishtey ( kisi aisey ghar mein nahi jatey jis mein moorat ya kutta ho."
"5961","unhon-ne aik gaddaa khareedaa jis mein moortein thin. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha to aap darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur andar nahi aaey. mein aap ke chehrey se narazagi pehchan gaee. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main Allah se iske rasool ke samney tauba karti hon, maine kya ghalati ki hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke gaddaa kaisa hai? maine arz kya ke maine hi usey khareedaa hai taake aap is par baithein aur tek lagaaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un moorton ke banaaney walon ko qiyamat ke din azab diya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ne paida kya hai ab unmein jaan bhi dalo aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis ghar mein moorat hoti hai us main (rahmat ke) Farishtey nahi dakhil hotey."
"5962","unhon-ne aik ghulam khareedaa jo pachhna lagata tha phir farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khoon nikalney ki ujrat, kuttey ki qeemat aur randii ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya hai aur aap ne sood leney waale, dene waale, godney waali, gudwaaney wali aur moorat banaaney waley par laanat bheji hai."
"5963","mein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tha log unse mukhtalif masayel poochh rahe they. jab tak unse khas taur se puchha na jata wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hawale nahi detey they phir unhon-ne kaha ke maine Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs duniya mein moorat banaaeyga qiyamat ke din is par zor daala jaeyga ke usey wo zinda bhi karey halanke wo usey zinda nahi kar sakta."
"5964","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par Sawar huey jis par fidak ki bani hui kamlii padi hui thi. aap ne Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ko usi par apne peechhey bitha liya."
"5965","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka Mukarrama tashrif laey (fatah ke mauqe par) to abdul-Muttalib ki aulad ne (jo Makka mein thi) aap ka istiqbaal kya. (ye sab bachchey hi they) aap ne az raah mohabbat aik bachchey ko apne samney aur aik ko apne peechhey bitha liya."
"5966","Ikrima ke samney ye zikr aaya ke teen aadmi jo aik janwar par chadhein usmein kon bahut bura hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka Mukarrama ( tashrif laey to aap qusum bin Abbas ko apni sawari par aagey aur Fazal-bin-Abbaas ko peechhey bithaaey huey they. ya qusum peechhey they aur Fazal aagey they (Raziallahu anhu) ab tum unmein se kisey bura kahogey aur kisey achchha."
"5967","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey betha hua tha aur mere aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan kajaawe ki pichhli lakdi ke siwa aur koi cheez haail nahi thi usi haalat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yaa-muaaz! mein bola ya Rasulullah! main hazir hun, aap ki itaat aur farmabardaarii ke liye taiyaar hun. phir aap ne thodi der tak chaltey rahe. iske baad farmaya : ya Muaaz! mein bola, ya Rasulullah! hazir hun aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. phir aap thodi der chaltey rahe iske baad farmaya : ya Muaz ! maine arz kya hazir hun, ya Rasulullah! aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tumhen malum hai Allah ke apne bandon par kya haq hain? maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool hi ko zyada ilm hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ke bandon par haq ye hain ke bandey khas uski ibadat karein aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na banaaein phir aap thodi der chaltey rahe. iske baad farmaya : Muaaz! maine arz kya, hazir hun ya Rasulullah! aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen malum hai bandon ka Allah par kya haq hai. jabke wo ye kaam kar lein. maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. farmaya ke phir bandon ka Allah par haq hai ke wo unhein azab na kare."
"5968","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar se wapas aa rahe they aur main abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey betha hua tha aur chal rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey thin ke achcha ontni ne thokar khaai, maine kaha aurat ki khabar-geeri karo phir main utar padaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye tumhari maan hain phir maine kajaawa mazbut baandha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sawar ho gaey phir jab Madina Munawra ke qareeb huey ya (raawii ne bayan kya ke) Madina Munawra dekha to farmaya ''ham wapas hone-waale hain Allah Taala ki taraf rujoo hone-waale hain, usi ko poojney waley hain, apne Malik ki tareef karne waley hain.''"
"5969","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid main ( chit ( letey huey dekha ke aap aik paon ko doosrey paon par utha kar rakhey huey they."